<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- YAO BIBLE VERSION</book>
  <para style="h">MALIKO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ngani Jambone mpela yatite pakulemba Maliko</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maliko</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mlk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ngani Jambone mpela yatite pakulemba</para>
  <para style="mt1">Maliko</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngani Jambone mpela yatite pakulemba che Maliko, chili chitabu chimpepe mu itabu ncheche mu Lilangano lya Sambano chachikusala yankati ngani ja umi u Che Yesu Kilisito. Chachilichose mwa itabu yo chikuŵilanjikwa “Injili,” malumbo gakwe “Ngani Jambone.” Yalembekwe ni che Matayo ni che Maliko ni che Luka ni che Yohana pakumala chiwa chi Che Yesu. Injili mpela yatite pakulemba che Maliko chili chitabu chejipi kupunda itabu yose ncheche. Sooni ikukulupilichika kuti mwa Injili syosye si jeleji jaliji jandanda kulembekwa mu yaka ya 65 mpaka 70, pakumala Che Yesu kupagwa. Ŵaumanyilisi ŵajinji akukulupilila kuti Injili ji jalembekwe ku Loma, nningwa wao ŵakamulisye ntima ŵakukulupilila ŵa chiloma ŵa kweleko.</para>
  <para style="ip">Che Maliko sooni akumanyika mpela che Yohana Maliko, ŵajawile pamo ni achinduna che Paolo ni che Banaba nambo ŵasoyesye lumbili lwao paŵalesile achinjakwe achendelechelaga ni ulendo wao wa masengo ga kwatumichila Akunnungu (Masengo 13:13). Kanyuma Che Maliko ŵalongene sooni ni che Banaba (Masengo 15:37-39). Sooni che Maliko ŵaliji mbusanga ju che Petulo (2 Petulo 5:13). Nambo che Maliko ŵaliji jwanchanda katema Che Yesu paŵatandaga masengo gao. Ŵaumanyilisi akukulupilila kuti che Maliko ŵalembile umboni u che Petulo, ni weleo uli nsingi wa Injili mpela yatite pakulemba che Maliko. Mu Ngani Jambone ji, che Maliko akunguluchile kwannope majiganyo gankati kuŵa jwakulijiganya ju Che Yesu ni majiganyo ga Che Yesu pa moŵa ga mbesi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yaili mwelemo</para>
  <para style="io">Che Maliko akuchimanyukusya chitabu chakwe (1:1-13).</para>
  <para style="io">Sooni che Maliko akusala yankati kutumichila ku Che Yesu paŵaliji ku Galilaya (1:14-45; 8:1-21).</para>
  <para style="io">Sooni akutusalila yankati Che Yesu iŵatite pakwendajenda ku Yelusalemu (8:22-38; 10:1-52).</para>
  <para style="io">Che Maliko akumalichisya kwa kulemba yankati katema Che Yesu paŵaliji Ku Yelusalemu, pamo ni chiwa chao ni kusyuka kwao (11:1-33; 16:1-8).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1"/>
  <para style="s">Che Yohana Ŵakubatisya akwalalichila ŵandu nkati Che Yesu Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohana 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1"/>Jeleji jili ndande ja Ngani Jambone ji Che Yesu Kilisito, Mwana jwa Akunnungu. <verse eid="MRK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2"/>Mpela ijitite pakulembekwa mmalembo ga che Isaya juŵaliji jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">“Akunnungu ŵatite, ‘Nguntuma jwantenga jwangu annongolele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">jwejejo ni juchankolochesye litala lyenu.’<verse eid="MRK 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3"/>Mundu akunyanyisya mwipululu achitiji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Mwakolochesye Ambuje litala lyao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">ngolosye mwakusaka kupita.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4"/>Che Yohana Ŵakubatisya ŵatamaga mwipululu ni kwalalichila ŵandu aleche sambi ni kwabatisya kuti Akunnungu ŵalechelesye sambi syao. <verse eid="MRK 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5"/>Ŵandu achajinji kutyochela chilambo cha Ŵayahudi ni musi wa ku Yelusalemu wose ŵajawile kukwapikanila che Yohana, ŵajitichisye sambi syao nombejo ŵabatisye mu lusulo lwa Yolodani.<verse eid="MRK 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6"/>Che Yohana ŵaliji awasile mwinjilo uwapotekwe ni manyunya ga chinyama chachikuŵilanjikwa ngamia ni nkaanda wa lipende nchiunu. Nombejo ŵalyaga itete ni uchi. <verse eid="MRK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7"/>Ni ŵalalichilaga kwa ŵandu kuti, “Panyuma pangu akwika jwali ni machili kumbunda une. None nganguŵajilwa namose kukotama ni kugopola ngoji sya italawanda yakwe. <verse eid="MRK 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8"/>Uneji ngumbatisya ni meesi, nambo jwelejo chaachimbatisya kwa Mbumu jwa Akunnungu.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubatiswa ni kulinjikwa kwa Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Matayo 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka 3:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9"/>Moŵa go, Che Yesu ŵaiche kutyochela musi wa ku Nasaleti wauli mu chilambo cha ku Galilaya ni ŵabatiswe ni che Yohana mu lusulo lwa Yolodani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10"/>Che Yesu paŵakopokaga mmeesi, ŵakuweni kwinani kuugwiche ni Mbumu jwa Akunnungu ŵantuluchile achiŵaga mpela nguunda. <verse eid="MRK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11"/>Liloŵe lya Akunnungu lyapikaniche kutyochela kwinani lichitiji, “Mmwejo ni Mwanangu jungunnonyela, nonyelwe nomwe.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12"/>Papopo Mbumu jwa Akunnungu ŵanlongwesye Che Yesu kwaula mwipululu. <verse eid="MRK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13"/>Ni ŵatemi mwipululu mo moŵa alobaini achilinjikwaga ni Shetani. Kukoko ŵatamaga pamo ni inyama ya mwitinji, nambo achikatumetume ŵa kwinani ŵaliji nkwakamuchisya.<verse eid="MRK 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwaŵilanga ŵakukoka ncheche ŵaakuye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Matayo 4:12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:15">Luka 4:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14"/>Che Yohana paŵataŵikwe mu nyuumba jakutaŵilwa ŵandu, Che Yesu ŵajawile ku chilambo cha ku Galilaya kwalalichila ŵandu Ngani Jambone ja Akunnungu. <verse eid="MRK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15"/>Ŵatite, “Katema kaiche ni Umwenye wa Akunnungu uŵandichile. Nneche sambi syenu ni kujikulupilila Ngani Jambone!”<verse eid="MRK 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16"/>Che Yesu paŵapitaga mungulugulu litanda lya Galilaya, ŵaweni ŵakukoka ŵaŵili, che Simoni pamo ni che Andulea mpwakwe ali nkukoka somba kwa lwau.<figure style="fig" file="07 Fishing.jpg" size="col" ref="1:16">Mundu jwakukoka somba ni nyau</figure> <verse eid="MRK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17"/>Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Munguye, none chinantende ŵanyamwe mme ŵakwaikanawo ŵandu kwa Ambuje.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18"/>Papopo ŵalesile nyau syao ni kwakuya.<verse eid="MRK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19"/>Che Yesu paŵajawile mmbujo kanandi, ŵaweni che Yakobo ni che Yohana, ŵanache ŵa che Sebedayo. Ni ŵanyawo ŵaliji mu ngalaŵa jao achisaulaga nyau syao. <verse eid="MRK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20"/>Papopo Che Yesu paŵaweni, ŵaaŵilasile, ni ŵanyawo ŵalesile che Sebedayo atati ŵao mu ngalaŵa pamo ni ŵakwapanganyichisya masengo, ni ŵakuiye Che Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akunkoposya mundu masoka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luka 4:31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21"/>Che Yesu pamo ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵaiche musi wa Kapelenaumu, ni palyaiche Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila, Che Yesu ŵajinjile mu nyuumba ja kusimanilana Ŵayahudi, ni ŵatandite kwajiganya ŵandu maloŵe gambone ga Akunnungu. <verse eid="MRK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22"/>Ŵandu wose ŵaŵampilikene ŵasimosile ni uwiganye wakwe, pakuŵa nganajiganya mpela ŵakwiganya Malajisyo, nambo ŵajiganyaga nti mundu jwali ni ulamusi.<verse eid="MRK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23"/>Papopo mundu jwakamwilwe ni lisoka juŵaliji mu nyuumba ja kusimanilana jila ŵanyanyisye, <verse eid="MRK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24"/>achitiji, “Ana nkusaka kututenda ichichi, mmwe Che Yesu jwa ku Nasaleti? Ana nnyiche kukutujonanga? Ngummanyilila kuti mmwejo ndi Jwanswela jwa Akunnungu!”<verse eid="MRK 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25"/>Che Yesu ŵalikalipile lisoka lyo achitiji, “Mmyalale! Munkopoche mundu jo.”<verse eid="MRK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26"/>Nipele lisoka lyo lyantinganyisye mundu jula kwa machili ni kunyanyisya, ni lyakopweche. <verse eid="MRK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27"/>Ŵandu wose ŵasimosile nnope ni ŵaliji nkuusyana, “Ana yelei ni yatiuli? Uli, gelega gali majiganyo ga sambano? Mundu ju akwete ulamusi wa kugakoposya namose masoka, nombego gakwajitichisya!” <verse eid="MRK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28"/>Nipele, ngani jakwe Che Yesu jajenele kwachitema palipose, kuchilambo chose cha ku Galilaya.<verse eid="MRK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwalamya ŵandu ŵajinji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matayo 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29"/>Che Yesu ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao pamo ni che Yakobo ni che Yohana ŵakopweche mu nyuumba ja kusimanilana jila ni kwaula ku nyuumba ja ŵanya che Simoni ni che Andulea. <verse eid="MRK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30"/>Akwegwao che Simoni jwankongwe, ŵagonile pachindanda ali nkulwala chiilu, ni Che Yesu naikape ŵasalilwe yankati jwakulwala jo. <verse eid="MRK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31"/>Nipele Che Yesu ŵanjaulile jwankongwe jo ni ŵankamwile nkono ni kunjinamukula. Ulwele ula wannesile nipele ŵatandite kwatelechela.<verse eid="MRK 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32"/>Ligulo, lyuŵa lili litiŵile, ŵandu ŵaajauchisye Che Yesu ŵakulwala wose ni ŵaŵakamwilwe ni masoka. <verse eid="MRK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33"/>Ŵandu wose ŵa musi wo ŵasongangene paluŵala lwa nyuumba. <verse eid="MRK 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34"/>Che Yesu ŵalamisye ŵandu ŵajinji ŵaŵaliji ni ilwele yakupisyangana ni kugakoposya masoka gamajinji gagaliji mwa ŵandu ŵala. Nganiŵapa masoka lipesa lyakuŵecheta chachilichose ligongo gaamanyilile ali ŵaani.<verse eid="MRK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwalalichila ŵandu ku Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luka 4:42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35"/>Kundaŵipe kukanaŵe kucha, Che Yesu ŵakopweche mu nyuumba jo ni kwaula paasa musi, pangali ŵandu kukupopela. <verse eid="MRK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36"/>Che Simoni ni achinjakwe ŵala ŵajawile kukwasosa. <verse eid="MRK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37"/>Paŵammweni ŵansalile, “Ŵandu wose ali nkunsosa mmwe.”<verse eid="MRK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38"/>Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Tukusachilwa tujaule mmisinda jine jajiŵandichile akuno, ni kweleko ngusachilwa ngalalichile Ngani Jambone, pakuŵa yelei ni inyichile.”<verse eid="MRK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39"/>Nipele, Che Yesu ŵajesilejesile ku Galilaya kose, achilalichilaga mmajumba gao ga kupopelela ni kugakoposya masoka.<verse eid="MRK 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akunswejesya mundu jwamatana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matayo 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40"/>Lyuŵa limo mundu jwa matana ŵaiche ku Che Yesu ni kwatindiŵalila ni kwachondelela kuti, “Mwasakaga muuswejesye!”<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:40 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Muuswejesye: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Matana galiji ulwele uwanlekasisye mundu kwaŵenda Akunnungu pakuŵa waliji usakwa.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41"/>Che Yesu ŵankolele chanasa, ŵajongwele nkono wao ni ŵankwaiye ni kwasalila, “Ngusaka, Nswejele!” <verse eid="MRK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42"/>Papopo matana gakwe gala gannesile ni ŵaswejele. <verse eid="MRK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43"/>Nipele Che Yesu ŵansalile ajaule achinjamukaga kwa machili, achinsalilaga, <verse eid="MRK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44"/>“Nnole, munansalile mundu jwalijose chindu chi, nambo njaule nkalilosye kwa jwambopesi, nkatyosye mbopesi mpela iŵatite pakusala che Musa kwalosya ŵandu wose kuti nnamile.”<verse eid="MRK 1:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45"/>Nambo mundu jula paŵakopweche, ŵatandite kwenesya ngani jo papalipose, namose Che Yesu nganakombola kwinjila sooni mmusi kwakulilosya. Nambo ŵatemi paasa musi, pangali ŵandu, atamuno yeleyo ŵandu kopochela papalipose ŵanjaulile kukokopeko.<verse eid="MRK 1:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2"/>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akunnamya mundu jwatatele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matayo 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1"/>Pagapite moŵa gampepe, Che Yesu ŵaujile sooni ku Kapelenaumu ni ŵandu ŵapilikene kuti ali pamusi. <verse eid="MRK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2"/>Nipele ŵandu ŵajinji ŵasongangene atamuno nganilisigala lipesa lyalililyose, ni ŵagumbele mpaka paluŵala. Che Yesu ŵaliji nkwalalichila Liloŵe lya Akunnungu. <verse eid="MRK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3"/>Pelepo ŵandu ncheche, ŵannyichisye mundu jwatatele ku Che Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4"/>Nambo kwaligongo lya winji wa ŵandu, nganakombola kunjausya jwakulwala pachiŵandi ni Che Yesu. Nipele, ŵapesekwile pa chipagala cha nyuumba palapala paŵaliji Che Yesu. Pelepo ŵantulwisye mundu jo ali agonile pa chitagala. <verse eid="MRK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5"/>Che Yesu paŵachiweni chikulupi chao chila, ŵansalile jwakutatala jula, “Mwanangu, nlecheleswe sambi syenu.”<verse eid="MRK 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6"/>Ŵampepe mwa ŵakwiganya Malajisyo ga Akunnungu gaŵapele che Musa ŵaŵatemi pepala, ŵaliji nkuliusya mmitima jao, <verse eid="MRK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7"/>“Ana akukombola chinauli kuŵecheta yelei? Akwatukana Akunnungu! Akunnungu pe ni ŵakukombola kulechelesya sambi.”<verse eid="MRK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8"/>Papopo Che Yesu ŵaimanyilile yanayose iŵaganisyaga mmitima jao, ni ŵausisye, “Ana ligongo chi nkuganisya yelei mmitima jenu? <verse eid="MRK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9"/>Ana chapi chachili chakwepepala, kunsalila mundu jwatatele ju, ‘Nlecheleswe sambi syenu,’ pane kunsalila, ‘Njimuche, njigale chitagala chenu njende’? <verse eid="MRK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10"/>Nipele, ngusaka mmanyilile kuti Mwana jwa Mundu akwete ulamusi wa kulechelesya sambi sya ŵandu pachilambo pano.” Papopo ŵansalile mundu jwatatele jula, <verse eid="MRK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11"/>“Ngunsalila, njimuche, njigale chitagala chenu, njaule kumangwenu!”<verse eid="MRK 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12"/>Ŵandu paŵannolechesyaga, mundu jula ŵajimwiche, ŵajigele chitagala chao ni kukopoka. Ŵandu wose ŵasimosile ni kwakusya Akunnungu achitiji, “Ngapagwa kose patwaiweni yanti yeleyi!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akummilanga che Lawi ŵaakuye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matayo 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13"/>Che Yesu ŵajawile sooni mungulugulu litanda lya Galilaya. Mpingo wa ŵandu wanjaulile ni Che Yesu ŵatandite kwajiganya.<verse eid="MRK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14"/>Paŵaliji nkupita, ŵammweni che Lawi mwanache ju che Alufayo ali atemi pa nyuumba ja kukumbikanyila nsongo. Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Munguye!” Che Lawi ŵajimi ni ŵankuiye.<verse eid="MRK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15"/>Kanyuma, Che Yesu ŵatemi mu nyuumba ji che Lawi kulya chakulya. Ŵakukumbikanya nsongo ŵajinji ni ŵandu ŵa sambi ni ŵandu, ŵaakuiye Che Yesu. Ni ŵajinji mwa ŵelewo ŵaliji nkulya pamo nawo ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao. <verse eid="MRK 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16"/>Ŵakwiganya Malajisyo ŵampepe ŵaŵaliji Mafalisayo, paŵaiweni kuti Che Yesu akulya pamo ni ŵandu ŵangakukundikwa ni ŵandu ni ŵakukumbikanya nsongo, ŵausisye ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵala, “Kwachichi akulya ni ŵandu nti ŵeleŵa?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17"/>Che Yesu paŵapilikene ŵaasalile, “Ŵandu ŵangakulwala ngakunlajila jwantela, nambo ŵakulwala. Une nganiika kukwaŵilanga ŵandu ŵambone, nambo ŵandu ŵa sambi.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Liusyo lyankati kutaŵa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matayo 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18"/>Katema kampepe ŵakulijiganya ŵa che Yohana ni ŵakulijiganya ŵa Mafalisayo ŵaliji nkutaŵa. Ŵandu ŵampepe ŵaiche ku Che Yesu ni kumbusya, “Ana ligongo chi ŵakulijiganya ŵa che Yohana ni ŵakulijiganya ŵa Mafalisayo akutaŵanga, nambo ŵakulijiganya ŵenu ngaakutaŵa?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19"/>Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Ana ŵakuŵilanjikwa ku ulombela akukombola kutaŵa ni jwanlombela ali pamo nawo? Ngwamba! Ngaakukombola kutaŵa. <verse eid="MRK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20"/>Nambo chiliiche lyuŵa mlombela jo pachajigalikwe mwa ŵanyawo, moŵa go ni pachachitaŵa.<verse eid="MRK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21"/>“Ngapagwa mundu jwakukata chigamba cha nguo ja sambano ni kuchitotela mu nguo jakuwisala. Pakuŵa atendaga yeleyo chigamba chasambano cho chichinyale ni kupapula nguo jakuwisala jo ni papapapwiche po chipapunde kupapuka. <verse eid="MRK 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22"/>Ni sooni ngapagwa mundu jwakutaga divai jasambano mmisaku ja mapende jakuwisala. Pakuŵa atendaga yeleyo divai jasambano chijitutumule misaku jo ni kujipapula, divai chijimwasiche ni misaku chijijonasiche. Divai ja sambano jikutajikwa mmisaku ja mapende ja sambano.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Liusyo lyankati Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matayo 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23"/>Pa Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila limo, Che Yesu pamo ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵaliji nkupita mmigunda ja ngano. Paŵaliji nkwenda ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵatandite kutema masache ga ngano. <verse eid="MRK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24"/>Mafalisayo ŵaausisye Che Yesu achitiji, “Nnole! Ligongo chi ŵakulijiganya ŵenu akutenda yaikanichikwe kuipanganya pa Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila?”<verse eid="MRK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25"/>Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Ana nganinsyome iŵatesile che Daudi ni achinjakwe pajakwete sala? <verse eid="MRK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26"/>Che Daudi ŵajinjile pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu ni ŵalile mikate jijatyochekwe nti sadaka kwa Akunnungu. Yeleyi yatendekwe katema che Abiasali ali Jwambopesi Jwankulu. Ŵambopesi pe ni ŵaŵasachilwe kulya mikate jo, nambo che Daudi ŵalile, sooni ŵapele achinjakwe.”<verse eid="MRK 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27"/>Nipele Che Yesu ŵamalichisye kuŵecheta, “Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila lyaŵichikwe kwaligongo lya kwakamuchisya ŵandu nambo ngaŵa ŵandu kulitumichila Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila. <verse eid="MRK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28"/>Nipele Mwana jwa Mundu ali Ambuje atamuno pa Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3"/>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akunnamya mundu jwapombotele nkono</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matayo 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1"/>Nipele Che Yesu ŵajinjile sooni mu nyuumba ja kusimanilana Ŵayahudi ni mmomo mwaliji ni mundu jwapombotele nkono. <verse eid="MRK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2"/>Ŵandu ŵampepe ŵaliji nkusosa ligongo lya kwakamulila Che Yesu. Nipele ŵaliji nkunnolechesya panepa chanlamye mundu jo pa Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila. <verse eid="MRK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3"/>Che Yesu ŵansalile mundu jwapombotele nkono jula, “Njise paujo.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4"/>Nipele Che Yesu ŵausisye, “Ana ili yambone pa Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila kuitendekanya yambone pane yangalumbana? Kukulupusya pane kuulaga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:4">Nambo ŵanyawo ŵamyalele. <verse eid="MRK 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5"/>Che Yesu ŵalolechesye wose kwa lutumbilo, ni ŵasupwiche ligongo mitima jao jaliji jekakatime. Nipele ŵansalile mundu jula, “Njongole nkono wenu!” Nombejo ŵaujongwele, ni nkono wao walamile. <verse eid="MRK 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6"/>Papopo, Mafalisayo ŵakopweche paasa pa nyuumba ja kusimanilana ni kuŵechetesyana ni ŵandu ŵa mpingo u che Helode itajile pakwaulaga Che Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mpingo wa ŵandu ukunkuya Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7"/>Che Yesu pamo ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵatyosile pelepo ni kwaula mungulugulu litanda lya Galilaya ni mpingo wa ŵandu wankuiye. Ŵandu wo ŵaumile mmisi ja ku Galilaya ni ku Yudea. <verse eid="MRK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8"/>Paŵapilikene iŵaitesile Che Yesu, ŵandu ŵane ŵaichilile kutyochela mmisi ja ku Yelusalemu ni ku Idumea ni mmisi jajili peesi lusulo lwa Yolodani, ni kutyochela mmisi ja ku Tilo ni ku Sidoni. <verse eid="MRK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9"/>Pakuŵa ŵandu ŵaliji ŵajinji, Che Yesu ŵaasalile ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵaŵichile chile ngalaŵa kuti ŵandu anaiche kwaŵijikanya. <verse eid="MRK 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10"/>Pakuŵa ŵaalamisye ŵandu ŵajinji, ŵakulwala wose ŵaliji nkututana kuti ŵakwaye. <verse eid="MRK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11"/>Ni ŵandu ŵaŵakamwilwe ni masoka paŵammonaga, ŵaligwisisye paujo pao ni kunyanyisya achitiji, “Mmwejo ni Mwana jwa Akunnungu!”<verse eid="MRK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12"/>Nambo Che Yesu ŵagakanyisye kwa chikali masoka ganaamanyisye ŵandu ŵane kuti ŵele ali ŵaani.<verse eid="MRK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwasagula achinduna likumi ni ŵaŵili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matayo 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13"/>Che Yesu ŵakwesile kwitumbi ni kwaŵilanga ŵandu ŵaŵasachile nsyene, nombewo ŵajaulile. <verse eid="MRK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14"/>Nipele ŵasagwile ŵandu likumi ni ŵaŵili ŵaŵaaŵilasile achinduna ni kwasalila, “Nansagwile nnonjele pamo none, sooni chinantume kukwalalichila ŵandu Ngani Jambone, <verse eid="MRK 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15"/>ni ŵanyamwe chinkole ulamusi wa kugakoposya masoka.”<verse eid="MRK 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16"/>Ŵeleŵa ni ŵandu likumi ni ŵaŵili ŵaŵasagwile, che Simoni ajula Che Yesu juŵampele liina liine che Petulo, <verse eid="MRK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17"/>ni Che Yakobo ni mpwakwe che Yohana ŵanache wa che Sebedayo, Che Yesu ŵapele liina liine Boanelige malumbo gakwe “Ŵandu ŵaali mpela ilindimo, pane akuŵilanjikwa ŵandu ŵaambumu.” <verse eid="MRK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18"/>Ŵane ŵaliji che Andulea ni che Filipo ni che Batolomayo ni che Matayo ni che Tomasi ni che Yakobo mwana ju che Alufayo, che Tadayo ni che Simoni jwakuŵilanjikwa Selote, ligongo ŵaliji jwakumenyanila chilambo chakwe, <verse eid="MRK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19"/>ni che Yuda Isikaliote, juŵangalawiche Che Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu ni Belesebuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Matayo 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20"/>Nipele Che Yesu ŵausile kumangwao. Mpingo wekulungwa wa ŵandu ŵasongangene sooni, mpaka Che Yesu ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao nganakombola kulya. <verse eid="MRK 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21"/>Achalongo achinjakwe paŵapilikene yelei, ŵapite kukwajigala ligongo ŵatite kuti jwampugwe.<verse eid="MRK 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22"/>Ŵakwiganya Malajisyo ŵaŵaumile ku Yelusalemu ŵatite, “Akwete Belesebuli! Jwankulu jwa masoka, jwakwapa machili ga kugakoposya masoka.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23"/>Pelepo Che Yesu ŵaaŵilasile ŵandu ni kwasalila kwa itagu achitiji, “Ana ikukomboleka Shetani kunkoposya Shetani njakwe? <verse eid="MRK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24"/>Iŵaga umwenye usapulene mipingo mipingo jajikumenyana, umwenye wo ngaujendelechela. <verse eid="MRK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25"/>Sooni iŵaga ŵandu ŵa nyuumba jimo asapulanaga mipingo mipingo ni kumenyana, ŵandu wo chajonasiche. <verse eid="MRK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26"/>Iyoyo peyo, umwenye wa Shetani, wasapulanaga mipingo mipingo ngaukola machili.<verse eid="MRK 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27"/>“Ngapagwa jwakupakombola kwinjila mu nyuumba ja jwamachili ni kunsumula ipanje yakwe yose, pangantaŵa kaje jwamachili jo. Pelepo ni pachachikombola kunsumula ipanje yakwe yose.<verse eid="MRK 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28"/>“Isyene ngunsalila, ŵandu chaalecheleswe sambi syao syose ni kwatukana kwao Akunnungu kose. <verse eid="MRK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29"/>Nambo, mundu jwalijose jwakuntukana Mbumu jwa Akunnungu ngalecheleswa sambi syo ng'o, pakuŵa chakole sambi sya moŵa gose pangali mbesi.” <verse eid="MRK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30"/>Che Yesu ŵaŵechete yeleyo ligongo ŵandu ŵaliji nkusala kuti, “Akamwilwe ni lisoka.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Achikulugwe ni achapwakwe Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matayo 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31"/>Achikulugwe ni achapwakwe Che Yesu ŵaiche pelepo, ŵajimi paasa ni kuntuma mundu akaaŵilanje Che Yesu nkati. <verse eid="MRK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32"/>Mpingo wa ŵandu watemi kwakwasyungula Che Yesu. Nipele jumo jwao ŵansalile, “Achikulu ŵenu ni achapwenu alinji paasa, akunsosa.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33"/>Nambo Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Ana achikulu ŵangu ni achapwanga ali ŵaani?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34"/>Pelepo ŵaalolechesye ŵandu uŵansyungwile ŵala ni kuti, “Nnole, ngwaona ŵandu ŵa mpela achikulu ŵangu ni achalongo ŵangu. <verse eid="MRK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35"/>Pakuŵa mundu jwalijose jwakuitendekanya yakuisaka Akunnungu, jwelejo ali achimwene jwangu ni mlumbwangu ni achikulu ŵangu.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4"/>
  <para style="s">Chitagu cha jwakupanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matayo 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1"/>Che Yesu ŵatandite sooni kwiganya ali mungulugulu litanda lya Galilaya. Mpingo wekulungwa wa ŵandu wansyungwile mpaka ŵajinjile mu ngalaŵa ni kutama mmomo. Ŵandu wose ŵatemi mungulugulu litanda. <verse eid="MRK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2"/>Che Yesu ŵatandite kwajiganya indu yejinji kwa itagu. Mmajiganyo gakwe ŵaasalile.<verse eid="MRK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3"/>“Mpilikanichisye! Jwakupanda ŵajawile kukumisa mbeju. <verse eid="MRK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4"/>Paŵamisaga, mbeju sine syagwilile mwitala ni ijuni yaiche ni kusimila. <verse eid="MRK 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5"/>Mbeju sine syagwilile pa lwala papaliji ni litaka kanandi, mbeju syamesile kwachitema pakuŵa litaka lyakwe lyaliji kanandi. <verse eid="MRK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6"/>Ni palyakopweche lyuŵa lyatinisye mimela, ligongo michiga jakwe nganijijinjilisya paasi. <verse eid="MRK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7"/>Mbeju sine syagwilile pa miiŵa, miiŵa jila jakusile ni kuiŵijikanya mimela, nombe mimela jo nganijisogola isogosi. <verse eid="MRK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8"/>Mbeju sine syagwilile pa chaajila, syamesile ni syakusile ni kusogola. Sine syasogwele makumi gatatu ni sine makumi nsano ni limo ni sine makumi likumi.”<verse eid="MRK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9"/>Che Yesu ŵatite, “Ŵaali ni mapilikanilo gakupilikana, apilikane.”<verse eid="MRK 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nningwa wa kwiganya kwa itagu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matayo 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10"/>Che Yesu paŵaliji pajika, ŵane mwa ŵaŵampilikene ŵala pamo ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao likumi ni ŵaŵili ŵanjaulile ni kumbusya malumbo ga itagu yo. <verse eid="MRK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11"/>Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Ŵanyamwe mpegwilwe kumanyilila yantemela ya Umwenye wa Akunnungu. Nambo kwa ŵane ŵaali paasa chalijiganye indu yose kwa itagu pe, <verse eid="MRK 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12"/>kuti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">‘Alolechesye, nambo anaone.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">Apilikanile, nambo anaimanyilile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">Pakuŵa amanyililaga chiŵagalauchile Akunnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">nombejo akaalechelesye sambi syao.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akutagula chitagu cha jwakupanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matayo 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13"/>Nipele, Che Yesu ŵausisye, “Uli ngankugamanyilila malumbo ga chitagu chi? Nambi chimmanyilile chinauli malumbo ga itagu ine? <verse eid="MRK 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14"/>Jwakupanda mbeju akupanda Liloŵe lya Akunnungu. <verse eid="MRK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15"/>Ŵandu ŵane akulandana ni mbeju sisyagwilile mwitala. Pakulipilikana Liloŵe lya Akunnungu, Shetani akwika ni kulityosya Liloŵe lyalipandikwe mmitima jao. <verse eid="MRK 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16"/>Ni ŵandu ŵane ali mpela mbeju sisyagwilile pa lwala. Ŵandu wo apilikanaga Liloŵe lya Akunnungu, papopo akulijitichisya mu kusangalala. <verse eid="MRK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17"/>Nambo ngalikwajinjila ni kola michiga mwa ŵanyawo, akulikamulisya kwa katema kakajipi. Nipele, kwatyochelaga kulaga pane masauko ligongo lya Liloŵe lya Akunnungu lila, pelepo akulilekanga. <verse eid="MRK 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18"/>Ŵandu ŵane ali mpela mbeju sisyagwilile pa miiŵa. Ŵandu wo ni ŵeŵala ŵakulipilikana Liloŵe lya Akunnungu, <verse eid="MRK 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19"/>ligongo lya lipamba lya umi wu ni kunonyelwa ni ipanje pamo ni kulajila indu ine yejinji, ikwajinjila ni kuliŵijikanya Liloŵe lyo, nombewo ngakukombola kulijitichisya Liloŵe yalikuti ni kusogola isogosi. <verse eid="MRK 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20"/>Nambo ŵandu ŵane ali mpela mbeju sisyagwilile pa chaajila sila. Ŵelewo akulipilikana Liloŵe lyo ni kulijitichisya, nombewo akusogola isogosi ŵane makumi gatatu ni ŵane makumi nsano ni limo ni ŵane makumi likumi.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chitagu cha lumuli lweunichikwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luka 8:16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21"/>Che Yesu ŵapundile kwasalila, “Ana mundu akupamba lumuli ni kuluikanawo nkati ni kuluunichila ni lulo pane kuluŵika kuusi chindanda? Ngwamba! Akuluŵika pachanya chindu chakuŵichila lumuli. <verse eid="MRK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22"/>Iyoyo, chindu chachilichose chachisisikwe chichioneche pakulanguka, ni chachilichose cheunichikwe chichiunukulikwe. <verse eid="MRK 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23"/>Ŵaali ni mapilikanilo gakupilikana, apilikane!”<verse eid="MRK 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24"/>Ni ŵapundile kwasalila, “Mpilikanichisye yambone inkwipikana yo! Lilamulo lilalila linkwalamulila ŵandu ŵane, Akunnungu chaachinnamulila ni ŵanyamwe wakwe, sooni chanjonjechesye. <verse eid="MRK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25"/>Pakuŵa mundu jwakwete chindu chajonjechekwe ni mundu jwanganakola chindu chasumulwe atamuno kanandi chakwete.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chitagu cha mbeju jajikumela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26"/>Che Yesu ŵajendelechele kuŵecheta, “Umwenye wa Akunnungu ukulandana ni mundu jwakumisa mbeju mu ngunda. <verse eid="MRK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27"/>Chilo akugona ni muusi akuŵa meeso, mbeju sikumela ni kukula. Nombejo ngakuimanyilila yaikutendekwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28"/>Litaka lisyene likutendekasya mmela kukula ni kusogola. Kundanda ukumela, sooni ukukoposya lisache kumbesi ukusogola ngano. <verse eid="MRK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29"/>isogosi yakomalaga pe, mundu jula akugungula ni chikwakwa chakwe, pakuŵa katema ka magungulo kaiche.”<figure style="fig" file="12 Sickle.jpg" size="col" ref="4:29">Mundu jwakugungula ngano ni chikwakwa</figure><verse eid="MRK 4:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chitagu cha mbeju jamwana ja haladali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-34">Matayo 13:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30"/>Che Yesu ŵausisye sooni, “Ana tutuulandanichisye ni chichi Umwenye wa Akunnungu? Kwaali tuutanje kwa chitagu chi? <verse eid="MRK 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31"/>Ukulandana ni mbeju ja haladali, mbeju jamwana nnope kupunda mbeju syose syasikupandikwa pachilambo. <verse eid="MRK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32"/>Nambo japandikwaga jikukula ni kuŵa chitela chachikulungwa kupunda mimela jose ja mu ngunda, nombecho chikuŵa ni nyambi syasikulungwa nnope ni ijuni ikwika kutaŵa isusi mu nyambi syakwe.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33"/>Che Yesu ŵalalichile ŵandu utenga wao kwa itagu yejinji yanti yele, ŵakungulwiche nawo mpela iŵatite pakukombola ŵanyawo kumanyilila. <verse eid="MRK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34"/>Nganaŵecheta ni ŵandu chachilichose pangali itagu, nambo paŵaliji pamo ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao pachisyepela ŵatagulile yose.<verse eid="MRK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akujitulasya mbungo jejikulungwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matayo 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35"/>Lyuŵa lilyolyo ligulo, Che Yesu ŵaasalile ŵakulijiganya ŵakwe, “Tujombochele peesi litanda.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36"/>Nipele ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵaulesile mpingo wa ŵandu ula, ni kwinjila mu ngalaŵa jiŵaliji Che Yesu ni kwaula nawo. Ilaila paliji ni ngalaŵa sine. <verse eid="MRK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37"/>Nipele jatandite kupuga mbungo jejikulungwa ni matumbela gajiputile ngalaŵa jila, nombejo jatandite gumbala meesi.<figure style="fig" file="09 Boat in Storm.jpg" size="col" ref="4:37">Ngalaŵa jikuputikwa ni mbungo jekulungwa</figure> <verse eid="MRK 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38"/>Che Yesu ŵaliji panyuma mu ngalaŵa ali agonile pa nsamilo. Ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵaajimwisye ni kwasalila, “Jwakwiganya, ana uli ngankuikosya kuti uweji tulinkonasika?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39"/>Che Yesu ŵajimwiche, ni kujikalipila mbungo jejikulungwa ni kugasalila matumbela, “Tulalani!” Papopo mbungo jatulele ni kwaliji jii. <verse eid="MRK 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40"/>Nipele Che Yesu ŵaasalile ŵakulijiganya ŵao, “Kwachichi nkogopanga? Ana nganimme kola chikulupi?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41"/>Ŵakulijiganya ŵajogwepe nnope ni ŵausyanaga, “Ana jweleju ali mundu jwanti uli? Mpaka chimbunga ni matumbela ikwapilikanila!”<verse eid="MRK 4:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5"/>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akunnamya mundu jwa masoka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matayo 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1"/>Che Yesu ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵaiche peesi litanda lya Galilaya, ku chilambo cha ku Gelasi. <verse eid="MRK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2"/>Nakopokape Che Yesu mu ngalaŵa, ŵasimene ni mundu juŵaliji ni lisoka achityochelaga ku malembe. <verse eid="MRK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3"/>Mundu jo ŵaliji nkutama ku malembe. Nganapagwa mundu juŵankombolaga kuntaŵa sooni namose ni minyolo. <verse eid="MRK 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4"/>Katema kakajinji ŵantaŵile makongolo ni makono gakwe kwa minyolo ni magwedegwede, nambo ŵagambaga kutulanya minyolo jo ni kutemanya magwedegwede mmakongolo. Ni ngapagwa mundu jwamachili juŵapakombwele kunkamula. <verse eid="MRK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5"/>Muusi ni chilo ŵaliji nkwendajenda ku malembe ni mmatumbi achinyanyisyaga ni kulikatanya ni maganga.<verse eid="MRK 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6"/>Mundu jo paŵambweni Che Yesu kwakutalichila, ŵambutuchile ni kwatindiŵalila. <verse eid="MRK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7"/>Ŵanyanyisye achitiji, “Mmwe Che Yesu, Mwana jwa Akumanani, ana nkusaka chichi kwanguune? Mu liina lya Akunnungu, ngunchondelela nnalagasye!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8"/>Ŵaŵechete yeleyo pakuŵa Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Mmwe lisoka, nkopoche mwa mundu ju.”<verse eid="MRK 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9"/>Che Yesu ŵambusisye, “Liina lyenu ŵaani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Nombejo ŵajanjile, “Liina lyangu Mpingo, pakuŵa tuli achajinji.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10"/>Nipele ŵachondelele kwannope Che Yesu kuti akasagakopochesya masoka go paasa musi ula.<verse eid="MRK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11"/>Chiŵandi ni chitulusya kwaliji ni mpingo wekulungwa wa maguluŵe gachilyaga. <verse eid="MRK 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12"/>Nipele, masoka gaachondelele Che Yesu gachitiji, “Ntujausye ku maguluŵe gala, tukagajinjile gelego.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13"/>Nombe Che Yesu ŵagalechele. Nipele masoka gala gankopweche mundu jula ni kwinjila mmaguluŵe. Mpingo wose wa maguluŵe waliji mpela mianda jiŵili waselelechele mu litanda, watitimile mmeesi ni kuwa.<verse eid="MRK 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14"/>Ŵandu ŵaŵachingaga maguluŵe go, ŵautuchile mmusi ni mmigunda kukwasalila ŵandu iyatendekwe yo. Ŵandu ŵaiche kukulola iyatyochele. <verse eid="MRK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15"/>Paŵaiche kuŵaliji Che Yesu kula, ŵammweni mundu julajula juŵakamwilwe ni mpingo wa masoka. Jwatemi ali awasile nguo syakwe ni jwana lunda, ni ŵandu ŵajogwepe nnope. <verse eid="MRK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16"/>Ni ŵandu ŵaŵaiweni aila iyatyochele, ŵaasalile ŵandu ŵane iyansimene mundu jwakamwilwe ni masoka jula ni ngani ja maguluŵe.<verse eid="MRK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17"/>Nipele, ŵandu ŵatandite kwachondelela Che Yesu kuti akopoche mu chilambo chao.<verse eid="MRK 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18"/>Che Yesu paŵaliji nkwinjila mu ngalaŵa, mundu juŵakamwilwe ni masoka jula ŵachondelele kuti alongane nawo.<verse eid="MRK 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19"/>Nambo, Che Yesu ŵakanile ni kwasalila, “Njaule kumangwenu, kwa achalongo achinjenu, nkaasalile yanayose yambone yampanganyichisye Ambuje ni yatite pakunkolela chanasa.”<verse eid="MRK 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20"/>Nipele mundu jula ŵajawile ni kutanda kwenesya ku chilambo chose cha Dekapoli, yaani misi likumi, indu yaikulungwa iŵapanganyichisye Che Yesu. Ŵandu wose ŵaŵapilikene ŵasimosile.<verse eid="MRK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwalamya jwankongwe jumo ni mwali ju che Yailo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matayo 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21"/>Che Yesu ŵajombweche sooni litanda lya Galilaya ni ngalaŵa. Paŵaliji mungulugulu litanda, mpingo wekulungwa wa ŵandu wasongangene pachiŵandi nawo. <verse eid="MRK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22"/>Pelepo jwaiche mundu jumo, jwankulu jwa nyuumba ja kusimanilana Ŵayahudi, liina lyakwe che Yailo. Paŵambweni Che Yesu, ŵaligwisisye paujo pa Che Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23"/>Nipele, ŵachondelele nnope achitiji, “Mwali jwangu akulwala nnope, ngummenda twende nkansajichile makono kuti alame ni kukola umi.”<verse eid="MRK 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24"/>Nipele, Che Yesu ŵatyosile achilonganaga ni mundu jula. Ŵandu ŵajinji ŵakuiye ni ŵaliji nkwaŵijikanya kosekose.<verse eid="MRK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25"/>Pelepo paliji ni jwankongwe juŵaliji ni magono kwa yaka likumi ni iŵili. <verse eid="MRK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26"/>Jwankongwe jo, ŵalasile nnope kwajaulila ŵamitela ŵajinji. Namuno ŵaliji atyosisye ipanje yakwe yose, nambo nganapata eja ni ulwele ula waliji nkuendelechela pe. <verse eid="MRK 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27"/>Jwankongwe jo paŵapilikene kuti Che Yesu akwalamya ŵandu, ŵapelete mu mpingo wa ŵandu ula ni kwajaulila Che Yesu kwa panyuma ni kukwaya chiwalo chakwe. <verse eid="MRK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28"/>Ŵaganisisye, “Nakwayaga pe chiwalo chao, chiilame.”<verse eid="MRK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29"/>Paŵakwaiye pe chiwalo chi Che Yesu, papopo magono gakwe galesile, nombe ŵalipikene pachiilu kuti alamile. <verse eid="MRK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30"/>Papopo Che Yesu ŵamanyilile kuti machili gakwe ganlamisye mundu. Nipele ŵaugalauchile mpingo wa ŵandu ni kuusya, “Ana nduni jwakwaiye iwalo yangu?” <verse eid="MRK 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31"/>Ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵajanjile, “Ngankwaona ŵandu yatiteje pakumbijikanya? Nambi nkuusya uli kuti, ‘Nduni jwangwaiye?’ ” <verse eid="MRK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32"/>Nambo Che Yesu ŵapundile kulolesyalolesya kuti ŵaone juŵatesile yeleyo jo. <verse eid="MRK 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33"/>Pelepo jwankongwe jo achimanyililaga iyasimene, ŵajaulile Che Yesu alinkutetemela kwa lipamba ni kuligwisya paujo pao, ni kwasalila usyene wose. <verse eid="MRK 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34"/>Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Mwanangu, chikulupi chenu chinnamisye. Njaule kwa chitendewele ni nlame ulwele wenu.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35"/>Che Yesu paŵaliji nkuŵecheta, ŵaiche ŵandu kutyochela ku nyuumba ji che Yailo, jwankulu jwa nyuumba ja kusimanilana Ŵayahudi jula ni ŵansalile, “Mwali jwenu jula ajasiche. Ligongochi nkunsausya Jwakwiganya?”<verse eid="MRK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36"/>Nambo Che Yesu nganagakosya maloŵe gaŵaŵechete ŵandu wo, nipele ŵansalile jwankulu jwa nyuumba ja kusimanilana Ŵayahudi jula, “Kasinjogopa, ngambe kulupilila pe.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37"/>Nipele Che Yesu nganasaka kulongana ni mundu jwalijose, ikaŵe che Petulo ni che Yakobo ni che Yohana mpwakwe che Yakobo. <verse eid="MRK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38"/>Paŵaiche ku nyuumba ji che Yailo, Che Yesu ŵaweni ŵandu alinkunyokonya kwa ililo ni kulila kwa malumbo. <verse eid="MRK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39"/>Che Yesu ŵajinjile mu nyuumba ni kwasalila ŵandu, “Kwachichi nkunyokonya ni kulila? Mwali nganajasika, agambile gona pe.”<verse eid="MRK 5:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40"/>Nombe ŵanyawo ŵansechile. Nipele Che Yesu ŵaakopwesye paasa wose, ŵaajigele atatigwe ni achikulugwe mwali jo pamo ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵatatu, ŵajinjile mu chuumba chiŵagonile mwali jo. <verse eid="MRK 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41"/>Ŵankamwile nkono ni ŵansalile, “Talisa, kumi,” malumbo gakwe, “Mwali, ngunsalila njimuche!”<verse eid="MRK 5:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42"/>Papopo mwali jo ŵajimwiche ni ŵajesile. Mwali jo ŵaliji ni yaka likumi ni iŵili. Pichakopochele chelecho ŵandu ŵala ŵasimosile kwa nnope. <verse eid="MRK 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43"/>Nambo Che Yesu ŵaalekasisye kwannope anaasalile ŵandu ŵane ngani jo. Nipele ŵaasalile, “Mwape chakulya alye.”<verse eid="MRK 5:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6"/>
  <para style="s">Ŵandu akunkana Che Yesu ku Nasaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matayo 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1"/>Che Yesu ŵatyosile pepala, ŵalongene ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao ni kwaula ku nsinda wakwe. <verse eid="MRK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2"/>Palyaiche Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila, Che Yesu ŵatandite kwiganya mu nyuumba ja kusimanilana Ŵayahudi. Ŵandu ŵajinji ŵaŵampilikene ŵasimosile achitiji, “Ana apatile kwapi yele indu yakuisala yi? Ana apatile kwapi lunda lu mundu ju mpaka akombole kuitendekanya yakusimonjeka? <verse eid="MRK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3"/>Ana aju ngaŵa jwakusepa jula, mwana ju che Maliamu ni achapwakwe ngaŵa che Yakobo ni che Yusufu ni che Yuda ni che Simoni? Ana achalumbugwe ngakutamanga papapa pamangwetu pa?” Kwa yele ŵankanile.<verse eid="MRK 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4"/>Nambo Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu akuchimbichikwa papalipose, nambo ngakuchimbichikwa mchilambo chakwe ni mwa achalongo achinjakwe ni kwa ŵandu ŵaali mu nyuumba jakwe.”<verse eid="MRK 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5"/>Che Yesu nganakombola kuitendekanya indu yakusimosya pa Nasaleti po, nambo nganatupa ŵakulwala ŵaŵaasajichile makono ni kwalamya. <verse eid="MRK 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6"/>Nombejo ŵasimosile nnope, ligongo ŵandu ŵa kweleko wo nganakulupililanga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Nipele Che Yesu ŵasyungwile mmisinda ja pachiŵandi ni pepala ni kwajiganya ŵandu.<verse eid="MRK 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwatuma ŵakulijiganya likumi ni ŵaŵili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matayo 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7"/>Che Yesu ŵaaŵilasile ŵakulijiganya ŵao likumi ni ŵaŵili ŵala, ŵatandite kwatuma ŵaŵili ŵaŵili ni kwapa ukombole wa kugakoposya masoka. <verse eid="MRK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8"/>Ni ŵaasalile, “Ngasinjigala chindu chachilichose mu ulendo ikaŵe nkongojo pe. Ngasinjigala chakulya chachilichose atamuno nsaku atamuno mbiya. <verse eid="MRK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9"/>Mbwale italawanda nambo ngasinjigala mwinjilo wine. <verse eid="MRK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10"/>Papalipose pachampochele nnonjele mmomo mpaka pachintyoche pelepo. <verse eid="MRK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11"/>Papalipose pachankane kumpochela ni kukana kumpilikanila, ntyoche pelepo nchikung'undaga luundu mmakongolo mwenu, kulosya kuti nkwajamuka, pakuŵa akanile kuupochela utenga wa Akunnungu.”<verse eid="MRK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12"/>Nipele ŵatyosile, ŵaalalichile ŵandu aleche sambi syao. <verse eid="MRK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13"/>Ŵagakopwesye masoka gamajinji, sooni ŵaapakesye mauta ŵakulwala ŵajinji ni kwalamya.<verse eid="MRK 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chiwa chi che Yohana Jwakubatisya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matayo 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14"/>Mwenye che Helode ŵasipikene ngani syo, pakuŵa liina li Che Yesu lyamanyiche papalipose. Ŵandu ŵampepe ŵatite, “Mundu ju ali che Yohana Jwakubatisya, asyuchile! Kwaligongo lyo akwete machili ga kupanganya yakusimonjeka.”<verse eid="MRK 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15"/>Nambo ŵane ŵatite, “Mundu ju ali che Elia.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Nombe ŵane ŵatite, “Ali jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu mpela aŵala ŵakulondola ŵa kalakala.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16"/>Nambo che Helode paŵapilikene yeleyi, ŵatite, “Jweleju ali che Yohana Jwakubatisya junankatile ntwe, asyuchile!” <verse eid="MRK 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17"/>Che Helode ŵaganisisye yeleyo pakuŵa, kundanda ko ŵaalajisye ŵandu kuti ŵakamule che Yohana ni kwataŵa mu nyuumba jakutaŵilwa ŵandu. Che Helode ŵatesile yeleyo ligongo ŵalombile che Helodia juŵaliji ŵankwakwe che Filipo mpwakwe. <verse eid="MRK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18"/>Che Yohana Ŵakubatisya ŵaasalilaga che Helode, “Ngaikuŵajilwa mmwe kwalomba ŵankwakwe mpwenu.”<verse eid="MRK 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19"/>Nipele che Helodia, ŵankwakwe mwenye, ŵanchimile nnope che Yohana, ŵasachile kwaulaga, nambo nganakombola. <verse eid="MRK 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20"/>Che Helode ŵanjogopaga che Yohana pakuŵa ŵaimanyilile kuti ŵaliji jwambone ni jwanswela, kwapele ŵanlindilile. Che Helode yaanonyelaga kwapilikanila che Yohana, nachiŵamuno yaapetekaga ntima kwannope paŵamalisyaga kwapikanila.<verse eid="MRK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21"/>Nambo lyuŵa limo, che Helodia ŵapatile lipesa pa lyuŵa lyakumbuchila kupagwa kwa che Helode. Che Helode ŵaapanganyichisye chindimba achakulu ŵa nkungulu wakwe, achakulu ŵa ŵandu ŵangondo ni ilongola ŵa chilambo cha ku Galilaya. <verse eid="MRK 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22"/>Nipele, mwali ju che Helodia ŵajinjile, ŵatyasile ni kunnonyelesya kwannope mwenye che Helode ni achalendo ŵakwe. Mwenye che Helode ŵansalile mwali jula, “Mumende chachilichose chinkuchisaka, chinampe.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23"/>Ni sooni ŵalumbilile, “Chachilichose chachimumende chinampe, atamuno mbindikati ja umwenye wangu.”<verse eid="MRK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24"/>Mwali jo ŵakopweche ni kwaula kwa achikulugwe kukwausya, “Ŵeende chichi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Achikulugwe ŵajanjile, “Mmende ntwe u che Yohana Jwakubatisya.”<verse eid="MRK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25"/>Mwali jula ŵausile kwa chitema kwa mwenye ni ŵaasalile, “Ngusaka muumbe sambano pejino, ntwe u che Yohana Ŵakubatisya mu mbale.”<verse eid="MRK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26"/>Mwenye jula ŵasupwiche nnope, nambo pakuŵa ŵanlumbilile paujo pa achalendo ŵakwe, nganakombola kunkanila. <verse eid="MRK 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27"/>Papopo mwenye ŵantumile jwangondo akajigale ntwe u che Yohana. Jwangondo ŵajawile mu nyuumba jakutaŵilwa ŵandu ni kwakata che Yohana ntwe. <verse eid="MRK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28"/>Ŵaichenawo ntwe ula mu mbale ni kumpa mwali, nombejo ŵampele achikulugwe. <verse eid="MRK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29"/>Ŵakulijiganya ŵa che Yohana paŵajipilikene ngani jo, ŵapite kukwigala chiilu chakwe ni kuchisika.<verse eid="MRK 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwalisya ŵandu elufu nsano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohana 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30"/>Achinduna ŵala ŵausile ku ulendo wao ni kunsalila Che Yesu yose iŵaitesile ni iŵaijigenye. <verse eid="MRK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31"/>Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Tujaule peuto pangali ŵandu kuti nkapumulile.” Ŵaŵechete yeleyo ligongo kwaliji kwana ŵandu ŵajinji ŵaŵaikaga ni kutyoka, namose Che Yesu ni ŵakulijiganya ŵakwe nganapatanga lipesa lyakuti alyanje. <verse eid="MRK 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32"/>Nipele ŵajinjile mu ngalaŵa achinsyene pe kwaula peuto pangali ŵandu.<verse eid="MRK 6:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33"/>Nambo ŵandu ŵajinji ŵaaweni paŵajaulaga po, ni ŵamanyilile. Nipele ŵandu ŵajinji ŵaumile misi jose ŵautuchile ni ŵalongolele kwika kwiuto kula, Che Yesu ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao akanaiche. <verse eid="MRK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34"/>Paŵatulwiche mu ngalaŵa, Che Yesu ŵauweni mpingo wekulungwa wa ŵandu, ŵaukolele chanasa ligongo ŵaliji mpela ngondolo syangali ni jwakuchinga ni ŵatandite kwajiganya indu yejinji. <verse eid="MRK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35"/>Palyaiche ligulo ŵakulijiganya ŵaajaulile Che Yesu ni kwasalila, “Sambano kuswele ni sooni mutuli muno mwipululu. <verse eid="MRK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36"/>Mwalanje ŵandu ŵa ajaulangane mmisinda jajiŵandichile pane mmigunda, akalisumile yakulya.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37"/>Nambo Che Yesu ŵatite, “Ŵanyamwe mwape chakulya alyanje.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Ŵanyawo ŵausisye, “Ana nkusaka tukasume mikate kwa mbiya syasijinji syanti yele, ni kwapa alyanje?”<verse eid="MRK 6:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38"/>Nambo Che Yesu ŵausisye, “Nkwete mikate jilingwa? Njaule nkalole.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Paŵajawile kukulola ni ŵansalile, “Jipali mikate nsano ni somba siŵili.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39"/>Che Yesu ŵaasalile ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵatamiche ŵandu wo pa manyasi gamaŵisi mipingo mipingo. <verse eid="MRK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40"/>Nombewo ŵatemi mmipingo ja ŵandu mia moja ni ja ŵandu hansini. <verse eid="MRK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41"/>Nipele Che Yesu ŵajigele mikate nsano jila pamo ni somba siŵili sila. Ŵalolite kwinani ni kwatogolela Akunnungu ni kujigaŵanya mikate jila. Ni ŵapele ŵakulijiganya ŵao kuti ŵagaŵanyichisye ŵandu. Ilaila ŵagaŵilenye ŵandu wose somba siŵili sila. <verse eid="MRK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42"/>Ŵandu wose ŵalile ni kwikuta. <verse eid="MRK 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43"/>Nipele ŵakulijiganya ŵakumbikenye sigasi sya mikate ni somba, ŵagumbesye itundu kumi na mbili. <verse eid="MRK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44"/>Achalume ŵaŵalile mikate jo ŵaliji mianda nsano.<verse eid="MRK 6:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwenda pachanya meesi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matayo 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohana 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45"/>Papopo Che Yesu ŵaasalile ŵakulijiganya ŵao ajinjilanje mu ngalaŵa alongolele ku Besesaida kwakuli peesi litanda. Nombejo ŵasigalile kuti aulanje mpingo wa ŵandu ula. <verse eid="MRK 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46"/>Paŵamasile kwalanga ŵandu, Che Yesu ŵakwesile kwitumbi kukupopela. <verse eid="MRK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47"/>Palyaiche ligulo, ngalaŵa jila jaliji pambindikati litanda, katema ko Che Yesu ŵaliji jikape kunsanga. <verse eid="MRK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48"/>Nipele ŵaweni ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵala achilagaga mu ngalaŵa, ligongo mbungo jaliji jininkwaputa. Kuninkucha Che Yesu ŵaŵandichile achendaga pachanya meesi ni ŵalitesile akwapelenganya. <verse eid="MRK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49"/>Nambo ŵakulijiganya ŵala paŵammweni ali nkwenda pachanya meesi, ŵaganisisye lilaika, ni ŵatandite gumilanga. <verse eid="MRK 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50"/>Pakuŵa wose paŵambweni ŵajogwepe nnope.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Papopo Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Muusimane ntima, ndili une, kasinjogopanga.” <verse eid="MRK 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51"/>Nipele ŵajinjile mu ngalaŵa jiŵaliji ŵakulijiganya ŵao mula ni mbungo jatulele. Ŵakulijiganya ŵasimosile nnope, <verse eid="MRK 6:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52"/>ligongo, ŵaliji akanamanyilile chatesile Che Yesu nkati mikate jila, pakuŵa mitima jao jatopelwe kumanyilila.<verse eid="MRK 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwalamya ŵakulwala ku Genesaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Matayo 14:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53"/>Che Yesu pamo ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵajombweche litanda, ŵaiche ku Genesaleti, pelepo ŵajijimiche ngalaŵa jao. <verse eid="MRK 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54"/>Paŵakopweche mu ngalaŵa, papopo ŵandu ŵaamanyilile Che Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55"/>Nipele ŵautwiche achisyungulaga pachilambo pose, ni kutanda kwajigalanga ŵakulwala ali agonile mmigono jao, ni kwajausya kulikose kuŵapilikene kuti Che Yesu ali kweleko. <verse eid="MRK 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56"/>Kulikose kuŵajawile Che Yesu, mmisinda, mmisi ni mmigunda, ŵandu ŵaliji nkwagoneka ŵakulwala peuto pakusumichisya malonda, ŵachondelele Che Yesu kuti ŵakulwala ŵakwaye namose luminiko lwa mwinjilo wao. Ni wose ŵaŵakwaiye ŵalamile.<verse eid="MRK 6:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7"/>
  <para style="s">Majiganyo ga Achachekulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Matayo 15:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1"/>Mafalisayo ŵampepe ni jwakwiganya Malajisyo ŵaŵatyochele ku Yelusalemu ŵasongangene paujo pa Che Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2"/>Ŵanyawo ŵaweni ŵakulijiganya ŵampepe ŵa Che Yesu akulya panganaŵa makono mpela iyasachilwaga ni Malajisyo ga Chiyahudi. <verse eid="MRK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3"/>Pakuŵa, Mafalisayo ni Ŵayahudi wose ngakulya chakulya panganaŵa mmakono, mpaka pachisukusuku achikamulisyaga masyoŵelo ga achachekulu ŵachiikala. <verse eid="MRK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4"/>Sooni paakutyokanga pakusumichisya malonda ngakulya chachilichose pangajosya kaje. Nombe akugakuyanga masyoŵelo gamajinji gaŵapochele kutyochela kwa achachekulu, mpela ila yakuti pakosya migao ni iteleko ni yoombo ya libati.<verse eid="MRK 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5"/>Nipele Mafalisayo ni Ŵakwiganya Malajisyo ŵala ŵausisye Che Yesu, “Kwachichi ŵakulijiganya ŵenu ngakugakuya masyoŵelo gitupochele kwa achachekulu ŵetu, nambo akwamba kulya chakulya mmakono muli musakele?”<verse eid="MRK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6"/>Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Ŵaulamba ŵanyamwe! Che Isaya, jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu, ŵalondwele yambone pa ŵanyamwe mpela iŵatite pakulemba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">‘Akunnungu akuti, ŵandu ŵa akunjimbichisyanga pakang'wa pe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">nambo mmitima jao ali kwakutalikangana ni une.<verse eid="MRK 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7"/>Kumbopelela kwao kwangali chindu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:7">ligongo akwiganya malajisyo ga ŵandu mpela ila akugajiganya Malajisyo ga Akunnungu.’<verse eid="MRK 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8"/>“Ŵanyamwe nkugaleka Malajisyo ga Akunnungu ni kugakamulisya masyoŵelo ga ŵandu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9"/>Che Yesu ŵapundile kuŵecheta, “Ŵanyamwe nkumanyi kukana kwa lunda lwenu Malajisyo ga Akunnungu kuti ngakuye masyoŵelo genu mwachinsyene! <verse eid="MRK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10"/>Pakuŵa che Musa ŵalajisye, ‘Mwachimbichisye atati ŵenu ni achikulu ŵenu,’ ni, ‘Mundu jwalijose juchantukane atatigwe pane achikulugwe, aulajikwe.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11"/>Nambo ŵanyamwe nkwiganya, iŵaga mundu akwete chindu chakombola kwakamuchisya achikulugwe pane atatigwe, nambo nkuti chindu cho chili ‘Kolibani’, malumbo gakwe chindu cho chityosyekwe sadaka kwa Akunnungu, <verse eid="MRK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12"/>nipele mundu jo ngakusachilwa sooni kwakamuchisya atatigwe pane achikulugwe. <verse eid="MRK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13"/>Yeleyo ni inkuti pakulijalusya Liloŵe lya Akunnungu kwa masyoŵelo ginkujiganyana. Ni sooni nkugatendekanya gamajinji ganti iyoyo.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Indu yaikuntendekasya mundu akakundikwa ni Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Matayo 15:10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14"/>Che Yesu ŵauŵilasile sooni mpingo wekulungwa wa ŵandu ula ni kwasalila, “Mumbikanichisye wose, ni mmanyilile. <verse eid="MRK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15"/>Ngapagwa chakulya chaakulya mundu, chachikuntendekasya aŵe jwangakundikwa ni Akunnungu. Nambo chachikukopoka nkati mwa mundu, ni chachikuntendekasya mundu jo aŵe jwangakundikwa ni Akunnungu. <verse eid="MRK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16"/>Ŵaali ni mapilikanilo gakupilikana, apilikane!”<verse eid="MRK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17"/>Paŵalekangene ni ŵandu ŵala ni kwinjila mu nyuumba, ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵambusisye malumbo ga chitagu cho. <verse eid="MRK 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18"/>Nombe Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Ni ŵanyamwe nganinkola umanyilisi? Ana ngankumanyilila kuti chakulya chaakulya mundu ngachikukombola kuntendekasya aŵe jwangakundikwa ni Akunnungu? <verse eid="MRK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19"/>Pakuŵa ngachikwinjila mu ntima mwakwe, nambo mlutumbo ni chikukopoka paasa pa chiilu pakwe.” Paŵaŵechete yeleyo Che Yesu ŵaitesile yakulya yose ikomboleche kuligwa.<verse eid="MRK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20"/>Ŵapundile kuŵecheta, “Chachikukopoka nkati mwa mundu ni chachikuntendekasya mundu jo aŵe jwangakundikwa ni Akunnungu. <verse eid="MRK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21"/>Pakuŵa mu ntima mwa mundu ni mwamukukopoka ng'anisyo syangalimate, ni chikululu ni wiyi ni uulasi, <verse eid="MRK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22"/>ni chikululu ni lipamo ni ungalumbana ni kulambusya ni kunyenga ni wiu ni kutukana ni chibuli ni kuloŵela. <verse eid="MRK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23"/>Yangalumbana yose yo, ikukopoka nkati mwa mundu, yose yo ni yaikuntendekasya mundu aŵe jwangakundikwa ni Akunnungu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chikulupi cha jwankongwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Matayo 15:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24"/>Che Yesu ŵatyosile pelepo, ŵajawile mu mmusi wauŵandikene ni ku Tilo. Ni kweleko ŵajinjile mu nyuumba jimo ni nganasaka mundu jwalijose aimanyilile, nambo nganakombola kulisisa. <verse eid="MRK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25"/>Jwankongwe jumo, juŵaliji ni mwali juŵakamwilwe ni lisoka, ŵapilikene ngani si Che Yesu. Ni ŵaajaulile ni kuligwisya pa makongolo gao. <verse eid="MRK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26"/>Jwankongwe jo ŵaliji Mgiliki ni nganaŵa Myahudi, juŵapagwile musi wa ku Silofonike ku chilambo cha ku Silia. Ŵaachondelele Che Yesu akankoposye mwali jwao lisoka. <verse eid="MRK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27"/>Nambo Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Ajikute kaje ŵanache, pakuŵa ngaŵa yambone kwigala chakulya cha ŵanache ni kusijasila mbwa syao.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28"/>Nambo jwankongwe jo ŵatite, “Elo, Ambuje, nambo ngati atamuno mbwa syasikutama kuusi mesa, sikulya mbakatika syakusigwisya ŵanache.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29"/>Pelepo Che Yesu ŵasalile, “Kwaligongo lya intite pakwanga, njaule kumusi. Lisoka linkopweche mwali jwenu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30"/>Nipele jwankongwe jo ŵausile kumangwao, ŵansimene mwanagwe agonile pachindanda ni lisoka lili linkopweche.<verse eid="MRK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akunnamya mundu jwangapilikana ni jwangaŵecheta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31"/>Nipele Che Yesu ŵatyosile ku chilambo cha ku Tilo ni kwaula ku litanda lya Galilaya achipitilaga ku Sidoni ni ku Dekapoli. <verse eid="MRK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32"/>Ŵaiche ŵandu ŵampepe ali anjigele mundu juŵaliji jwangapikana ni jwangaŵecheta, ŵaachondelele Che Yesu ansajichile makono mundu jo ni kunlamya. <verse eid="MRK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33"/>Che Yesu ŵantyosisye mundu jo mu mpingo wa ŵandu ni kunjausya pangali ŵandu, ŵaŵisile yala mmapilikanilo ga mundu jula. Ŵasunile mata pa chaala chakwe ni kunkwaya lulimi mundu jula. <verse eid="MRK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34"/>Nipele Che Yesu ŵalolite kwinani kwa Akunnungu ni kwisya ntima, ŵansalile mundu jo, “Efata,” malumbo gakwe “Mbuguche.”<verse eid="MRK 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35"/>Papopo mapilikanilo ga mundu jula gaugwiche ni lulimi lwakwe lwagopweche, nipele ŵatandite kuŵecheta uchenene. <verse eid="MRK 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36"/>Che Yesu ŵakanyisye ŵandu ŵala kuti akansalila mundu jwalijose yelei. Namuno ŵapundile kwakanyisya, ŵanyawo ŵapundisye kuijenesya yeleyo. <verse eid="MRK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37"/>Ni ŵandu ŵasimosile nnope ni kuti, “Atesile yose mwambonepe, namose ŵangapilikana akwatenda apilikane ni ŵangaŵecheta akwatenda aŵechete!”<verse eid="MRK 7:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8"/>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwalisya ŵandu elufu nne</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Matayo 15:32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1"/>Pa moŵa go, mpingo wekulungwa wa ŵandu wasongangene sooni. Pakuŵa nganakolanga chakulya, Che Yesu ŵaaŵilasile ŵakulijiganya ŵao ni kwasalila, <verse eid="MRK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2"/>“Ngwakolela chanasa ŵandu ŵa, ligongo atemi none kwa moŵa gatatu ni nganakolanga chakulya. <verse eid="MRK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3"/>Naalekaga ajaulangane mmangwao ni sala, komboleka chakomochanje mwitala, pakuŵa ŵampepe mwa ŵanyaŵa atyochele kwakutalika.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4"/>Ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵambusisye, “Patuli pano mwipululu, ana chitupate kwapi chakulya chakomboleka kwalisya ŵandu wose ŵa?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5"/>Che Yesu ŵausisye, “Ana nkwete mikate jilingwa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Ŵanyawo ŵajanjile, “Saba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6"/>Che Yesu ŵaasalile ŵandu ŵala atame paasi. Ŵajigele mikate saba jila ni ŵaatogolele Akunnungu, ŵagaŵenye ni kwapa ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵala kuti ŵaagaŵile ŵandu, nombewo ŵaagaŵile ŵandu wo. <verse eid="MRK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7"/>Sooni ŵakwete tusomba kanandi. Che Yesu ŵaatogolele Akunnungu ni ŵaasalile ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵaagaŵile ŵandu. <verse eid="MRK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8"/>Ŵandu ŵala ŵalile ni kwikuta. Nipele ŵakulijiganya ŵakumbikenye sigasi ni ŵagumbesye itundu saba. <verse eid="MRK 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9"/>Ŵandu ŵaŵalile ŵala ŵaliji mpela elufu nne. Nipele Che Yesu ŵalanjile, <verse eid="MRK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10"/>papopo ŵakwesile mu ngalaŵa pamo ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao ni kwaula chilambo cha ku Dalamanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mafalisayo akusaka chimanyisyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matayo 12:38-42</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">16:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11"/>Ŵaiche Mafalisayo ŵane ni ŵagatandite makani ni Che Yesu achisakaga kwatanjisya. Ŵaasachile atende chimanyisyo kulosya kuti ukombole wao ukutyochela kwinani kwa Akunnungu. <verse eid="MRK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12"/>Che Yesu ŵasupwiche nikuti, “Kwachichi ŵandu ŵa moŵa gano akusakanga chimanyisyo? Isyene ngunsalila, ŵandu ŵa ngaapegwa chimanyisyo chachilichose.”<verse eid="MRK 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13"/>Nipele, Che Yesu ŵalekangene nawo ŵandu ŵala, ŵajinjile mu ngalaŵa ni kombochela peesi.<verse eid="MRK 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amila ja Mafalisayo ni ja che Helode</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Matayo 16:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14"/>Ŵakulijiganya ŵa Che Yesu ŵaliŵalile kwigala mikate, ŵakwete nkate umo pe mu ngalaŵa mula. <verse eid="MRK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15"/>Che Yesu ŵaajamwiche achitiji, “Nlilolechesye, ni kuligosa ni amila ja Mafalisayo ni ja che Helode.”<verse eid="MRK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16"/>Ŵakulijiganya ŵala ŵatandite kuŵechetesyana achinsyene pe, “Akuŵecheta yelei ligongo nganitukola mikate.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17"/>Che Yesu ŵaimanyilile iŵaliji nkuŵechetesyana, ni ŵausisye, “Kwachichi nkuusyana yati nganinjigala mikate? Ana mpaka sambano ngankulijiganya pane kumanyilila? Kwachichi ngankuganisya? <verse eid="MRK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18"/>Meeso nkwete, ana ngankulolanga? Mapilikanilo nkwete, ana ngankupilikana? Ana ngankukumbuchila <verse eid="MRK 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19"/>panagaŵenye mikate nsano jila ni kwapa ŵandu elufu tano, mwagumbesye itundu ilingwa ya sigasi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Ŵakulijiganya ŵajanjile, “Itundu kumi na mbili.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20"/>Ŵausisye sooni, “Panagaŵenye mikate nsano ni jiŵili ni kwapa ŵandu elufu nne, ana mwagumbesye itundu ilingwa ya sigasi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Ŵakulijiganya ŵala ŵajanjile, “Itundu saba.” <verse eid="MRK 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21"/>Che Yesu ŵausisye, “Nganimme kumanyilila?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akunnamya mundu jwangalola ku Besesaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22"/>Che Yesu pamo ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵaiche ku nsinda wa ku Besesaida. Kukoko ŵandu ŵampelechele mundu jwangalola, ni ŵaachondelele Che Yesu kuti ankwaye kuti anlamye. <verse eid="MRK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23"/>Che Yesu ŵankamwile nkono mundu jwangalola jo ni ŵakopweche nawo paasa nsinda. Ni ŵansunile mata mmeeso, ŵasajichile makono ni ŵambusisye, “Nkukombola kuchiona chachilichose?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24"/>Mundu jwangalola jula ŵalolite nikuti, “Ngwaona ŵandu ali nkuoneka mpela itela ili nkwenda.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25"/>Che Yesu ŵasajiche sooni makono gakwe mmeeso mwa jwangalola jula, nombejo ukombole wakwe wa kulola wammujilile. <verse eid="MRK 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26"/>Che Yesu ŵansalile mundu jo ajaule kumangwakwe ni kunkanya achitiji, “Nkaujila ku nsinda ni kwasalila ŵandu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Petulo akusala pangasisa kuti Che Yesu ali Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Matayo 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27"/>Che Yesu ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵajawile ku misi ja Kaisalia Filipi. Paŵaliji mwitala, Che Yesu ŵausisye ŵakulijiganya ŵao, “Ana ŵandu akuti une ndili nduni?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28"/>Ŵakulijiganya ŵala ŵajanjile, “Ŵane akuti ŵalakwe ndi che Yohana Ŵakubatisya, ŵane akuti ndi che Elia ni ŵane akuti ndi jumo jwa Ŵakulondola ŵa Akunnungu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29"/>Che Yesu ŵausisye ŵakulijiganya ŵao, “Ŵanyamwe nkuti uneji nduni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Che Petulo ŵajanjile, “Ŵalakwe ndi Kilisito, Jwasagulikwe ni Akunnungu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30"/>Nipele Che Yesu ŵajamwiche achitiji, “Ngasimunsalila mundu jwalijose chelechi nkati une.”<verse eid="MRK 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akuŵecheta ngani ja kusauka, chiwa ni kusyuka kwakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Matayo 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31"/>Che Yesu ŵatandite kwajiganya ŵakulijiganya ŵao achitiji, “Mwana jwa Mundu akusachilwa asauche kwannope ni kukanikwa ni achachekulu ni achakulu ŵambopesi ni ŵakwiganya Malajisyo. Nipele chachiulajikwa, nambo chasyuche pa lyuŵa lyaatatu.” <verse eid="MRK 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32"/>Che Yesu ŵaasalile yelei pangasisa. Nipele che Petulo ŵanjigele Che Yesu pajika ni kutanda kwakalipila kuti anasale indu yo. <verse eid="MRK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33"/>Nambo Che Yesu ŵagalawiche, ŵaalolechesye ŵakulijiganya ŵao ni kwakalipila che Petulo achitiji, “Shetani, ntyoche apa! Pakuwa ngankuganisya ngani ja Akunnungu nambo nkuganisya ngani sya ŵandu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34"/>Nipele ŵauŵilasile mpingo wa ŵandu pamo ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao ni kwasalila, “Mundu jwalijose jwakusaka kuunguya, akatenda yakuisaka nsyene, aŵeje chile kusauka kwa kulitwika nsalaba wakwe kwaligongo lyangu une ni kuunguya. <verse eid="MRK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35"/>Pakuŵa jwalijose jwakusaka kuukulupusya umi wakwe nsyene, chaujase. Nambo, jwalijose jwakuujasa umi wakwe, kwaligongo lyangu une, ni sooni kwaligongo lya Ngani Jambone, chaukulupusye. <verse eid="MRK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36"/>Ana mundu chapate chichi achikolaga chipanje chose cha pachilambo ni kwasa umi wakwe wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi? <verse eid="MRK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37"/>Pane mundu chatyosye chichi kuti auusye umi wakwe wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi? <verse eid="MRK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38"/>Mundu jwalijose angolelaga soni une pamo ni ngani jangu mu uŵelesi wu wangalumbana ni wangaajogopa Akunnungu, Mwana jwa Mundu chankolele soni mundu jo, katema kachaiche mu ukulu wa Atati ŵakwe, pamo ni achikatumetume ŵa kwinani ŵaswela.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1"/>Che Yesu ŵapundile kwasalila, “Isyene ngunsalila, apali ŵandu ŵane papapa chiŵaone Akunnungu achitawalaga ni machili kwa matala gakupisyangana akanaŵe kuwa.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akugalauka usyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Matayo 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2"/>Pagapite moŵa nsano ni limo, Che Yesu ŵaajigele che Petulo ni che Yakobo ni Che Yohana, ŵalongene nawo pa chitumbi cheleu pajikape. Kweleko ku meeso ku Che Yesu kwagalawiche paujo pao. <verse eid="MRK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3"/>Iwalo yakwe yaliji yeswela mbee yanti mundu jwalijose jwa pachilambo pano ngakupakombola kuswejesya chanti yeleyo. <verse eid="MRK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4"/>Nipele, che Elia ni che Musa ŵakopochele paujo pao ni ŵaliji nkukunguluka ni Che Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5"/>Che Petulo ŵasalile Che Yesu achitiji, “Jwakwiganya, ikaliji yambone kuti uwe tutame panopano. Tutaŵe masakasa gatatu, limo lyenu ni limo li che Musa ni liine li che Elia.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6"/>Che Petulo nganachimanya chakuŵecheta pakuŵa wose ŵajogwepe kwannope.<verse eid="MRK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7"/>Nipele, lyakopochele liunde ni kwaunichila, liloŵe lyakopochele mu liunde lichitiji, “Aju ni Mwanangu jungunnonyela, mumpilikanile jwelejo.” <verse eid="MRK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8"/>Papopo ŵakulijiganya ŵalolite akuno ni akunokuno, nambo nganambona mundu jwine ikaŵe Che Yesu pe.<verse eid="MRK 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9"/>Paŵatulukaga pa chitumbi, Che Yesu ŵakanyisye ŵanyawo kuti yele iŵaiweni akansalila mundu jwalijose mpaka Mwana jwa Mundu pachachisyuka.<verse eid="MRK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10"/>Nipele, ŵakulijiganya ŵagakamulichisye maloŵe go, nambo ŵaliji nkuusyana achinsyene pe, “Kusyuka malumbo gakwe chichi?” <verse eid="MRK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11"/>Nipele, ŵausisye Che Yesu, “Ana kwachichi ŵakwiganya Malajisyo akusala kuti, chaiche kaje Che Elia?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12"/>Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Elo, che Elia chaiche kaje kukuŵika chile indu yose. Nambi kwachichi ilembekwe Mmalembelo ga Akunnungu kuti, Mwana jwa Mundu chasauche kwannope ni kukanikwa? <verse eid="MRK 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13"/>Nambo une ngunsalila, che Elia ŵamasile kwika ni ŵandu ŵampanganyichisye chachilichose chiŵasachile, mpela Malembelo ga Akunnungu yagakuti kusala nkati ŵelewo.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akunnamya jwanchanda jwakamwilwe ni masoka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Matayo 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14"/>Che Yesu ni aŵala ŵakulijiganya ŵatatu paŵaaichilile ŵakulijiganya ŵane ŵala, ŵaweni ŵandu ŵajinji ali ŵasyungwile achikanilanaga ni ŵakwiganya Malajisyo. <verse eid="MRK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15"/>Papopo, ŵandu wose paŵambweni Che Yesu, ŵasimosile kwannope, ŵautuchile kukwakomasya. <verse eid="MRK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16"/>Che Yesu ŵausisye ŵakulijiganya ŵao, “Ana nkukanilana nawo ichichi?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17"/>Mundu jumo mu mpingo wa ŵandu mula ŵajanjile, “Jwakwiganya, nannyichenawo mwanangu kukwenu jwakamwilwe ni lisoka lyalikuntendekasya anakombole kuŵecheta. <verse eid="MRK 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18"/>Katema kose lisoka palikunjinjila, likungwisya paasi ni likuntendekasya mwanache jo chikopoche chiulo nkang'wa, achichilimyaga meeno ni kukakamala chiilu. Naaŵendile ŵakulijiganya ŵenu alikoposye, nambo ŵalepele.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19"/>Nipele, Che Yesu ŵaasalile ŵakulijiganya ŵao, “Mwanya uŵelesi wangali chikulupi! Ana chindame ni ŵanyamwe mpaka chakachi? Chinampililile mpaka chakachi? Munyichisye mwanache jo.”<verse eid="MRK 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20"/>Ŵannyichisye ku Che Yesu. Lisoka palyambweni Che Yesu, papopo lyantasile njilinjili jwanchanda jo, nombe ŵagwile paasi, ŵagalagete akuno alinkukopoka chiulo kukang'wa. <verse eid="MRK 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21"/>Che Yesu ŵammusisye atatigwe jwanchanda jo, “Jwanchanda ju yatandite chakachi yelei?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Ŵajanjile, “Chitandile wanache wakwe. <verse eid="MRK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22"/>Katema kakajinji lisoka lyo lyangwisyaga pa mooto ni mmeesi kuti lyaulaje. Nambo iŵaga nkukombola kutendekanya chachilichose, ntukolele chanasa ni kutukamusya!”<verse eid="MRK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23"/>Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Kwachichi nkuti, ‘Iŵaga ngukombola’? Yose ikukomboleka kwa mundu jwakukulupilila.”<verse eid="MRK 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24"/>Papopo atatigwe jwanchanda jo ŵanyanyisye, “Ngukulupilila! Nambo chikulupi changu chili chamwana, mungamuchisye ngole chikulupi chachikulungwa.”<verse eid="MRK 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25"/>Che Yesu paŵaweni kuti ŵandu ŵajinji ali nkusongangana paujo pao, walijamwiche lisoka lila ni kulisalila, “Mmwe lisoka linkulekasya kuŵecheta ni kupilikana, ngunlamula nkopoche mwa jwanchanda ju, ni nkajinjila sooni.”<verse eid="MRK 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26"/>Pelepo lisoka lyanyanyisye, lyangwisisye njilinjili jwanchanda jo ni lyankopweche. Jwanchanda jwaoneche mpela jwammwe, ni ŵandu ŵane ŵatite “Awile!” <verse eid="MRK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27"/>Nambo Che Yesu ŵankamwile nkono jwanchanda jo, ŵankamwisye ajimuche, nombejo ŵajimi.<verse eid="MRK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28"/>Che Yesu paŵajinjile mu nyuumba, ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵausisye pajika, “Kwachichi twalepele kulikoposya lisoka lyo?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29"/>Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Lisoka lyanti yelei ngalikukopoka kwa litala lyalililyose ikaŵe kwa kwapopelela Akunnungu pe.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akuŵecheta sooni yankati chiwa chakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matayo 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luka 9:43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30"/>Che Yesu ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵatyosile peuto pala, ni ŵajendelechele ni ulendo kupitila ku chilambo cha ku Galilaya. Nganasaka mundu jwalijose akumanye kuŵaliji, <verse eid="MRK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31"/>pakuŵa ŵaliji nkwajiganya ŵakulijiganya ŵao, ŵasalile, “Mwana jwa Mundu chaŵichikwe mmakono mwa ŵandu, nombewo chammbulaje. Nambo pa lyuŵa lyaatatu chiulajikwa pe chasyuche.”<verse eid="MRK 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32"/>Nambo ŵakulijiganya ŵao nganagamanyililaga malumbo ga maloŵe go, ni ŵajogwepe kumbusya.<verse eid="MRK 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nduni jwali jwankulu?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matayo 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33"/>Paŵaiche musi wa ku Kapelenaumu ŵajinjile mu nyuumba, nombe Che Yesu ŵausisye ŵakulijiganya ŵao, “Ana mwitala mula mwakanilanaga ichichi?”<verse eid="MRK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34"/>Nambo ŵanyawo ŵamyalele, pakuŵa paŵaliji mwitala mula, ŵaliji nkukanilana yankati nduni jwali jwankulungwa mwa ŵanyawo. <verse eid="MRK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35"/>Che Yesu ŵatemi paasi, ni ŵaaŵilasile ŵakulijiganya ŵao likumi ni ŵaŵili ŵaasalile, “Mundu jwakusaka kuŵa jwankulu akusachilwa alitulusye ni kuŵa jwannandi ni katumetume jwa wose.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36"/>Sooni ŵanjigele mwanache ni kunjimika pasikati jao, ŵanjangete ni kwasalila, <verse eid="MRK 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37"/>“Jwalijose jwakumpochela mwanache mpela aju mu liina lyangu, akuumbochela une, ni mundu jwakuumbochela une akwapochela ŵelewo ŵandumile une.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mundu jwalijose jwangakutukanila ali pamo ni uwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luka 9:49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38"/>Che Yohana ŵaasalile Che Yesu, “Jwakwiganya, twammweni mundu ali nkugakoposya masoka mu liina lyenu, ni twankanyisye ligongo nganaŵa njetu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39"/>Nambo Che Yesu ŵatite, “Kasimunkanya, pakuŵa ngapagwa mundu jwakupanganya yakusimonjeka kwa liina lyangu ni papopo kumechetela gangalumbana. <verse eid="MRK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40"/>Ligongo mundu jwalijose jwangakutukanila ali pamo ni uwe. <verse eid="MRK 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41"/>Isyene ngunsalila, mundu jwalijose jwakumpa ngao wa meesi ga kung'wa, ligongo mwanya ndi ŵandu ŵakwe Kilisito, isyene jwelejo chapochele mbote jakwe.<verse eid="MRK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yakuleŵekasya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Matayo 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42"/>“Mundu jwalijose juchantendekasye jumo jwa achanandi ŵa ŵakungulupilila une atende sambi, ikaliji yambone kwa jwelejo litaŵikwe liganga lyekulungwa lya kusyajila pa lukosi pao ni kwaponya mu bahali kupunda kulamulikwa ni Akunnungu. <verse eid="MRK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43"/>Iŵaga nkono wenu ukunneŵasya, mmukate! Mmbaya kwinjila mu umi ni nkono umo, kupunda kuŵa ni makono gaŵili ni kuponyekwa pa mooto wangasimika, moŵa gose pangali mbesi. <verse eid="MRK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44"/>Kweleko mbisu ngasikuwa ni mooto wakwe ngaukusima. <verse eid="MRK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45"/>Ni iŵaga lukongolo lwenu lukunneŵasya, mmukate! Mmbaya kwinjila mu umi ni lukongolo lumo kupunda kuŵa ni makongolo gaŵili ni kuponyekwa ku jehanamu pa mooto wangasimika, moŵa gose pangali mbesi. <verse eid="MRK 9:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46"/>Kweleko mbisu ngasikuwa ni mooto wakwe ngaukusima. <verse eid="MRK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47"/>Iyoyo peyo iŵaga liso lyenu likunneŵasya, nlikolopole! Mbaya kwinjila ku umwenye wa Akunnungu ni liso limo kupunda kuŵa ni meeso gaŵili ni kuponyekwa pa mooto wangasimika, moŵa gose pangali mbesi. <verse eid="MRK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48"/>Kweleko mbisu ngasikuwa ni mooto wakwe ngaukusima.<verse eid="MRK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49"/>“Pakuŵa jwalijose chaachiswejeswa ni mooto mpela mbopesi ijikuti pakuswejeswa ni njete.<verse eid="MRK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50"/>“Njete jili jambone, nambo njete jasoyesyaga kulasa kwakwe, chintaje chichi kuti unonye wakwe uujile sooni?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:50">“Nkolanje njete ja uganja pasikati jenu, ntamanje mu chitendewele.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10"/>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwiganya yankati ulombela ni kulekangana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Matayo 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1"/>Che Yesu ŵatyosile pelepo, ŵajawile kuchilambo cha ku Yudea mpaka peesi lusulo lwa Yolodani. Mpingo wa ŵandu ŵajinji waajaulile sooni, nombejo ŵajiganyisye mpela iŵatite pakusyoŵelela.<verse eid="MRK 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2"/>Nipele, Mafalisayo ŵane ŵajaulile ni kwalinga kwa kwawusya, “Ana Malajisyo ga Akunnungu gakukunda kuti jwannume kwaleka ŵankwakwe?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3"/>Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Ana che Musa ŵannajisye chichi?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4"/>Ŵanyawo ŵajanjile, “Che Musa ŵalajisye kuti, jwannume akukombola kumpa talaka ŵankwakwe ni kwaleka.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5"/>Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Che Musa ŵagalembile malajisyo go kwaligongo lya ungajiganyikwa wenu. <verse eid="MRK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6"/>Nambo che Musa ŵalembile, chitandile kupagwa kwa chilambo, Akunnungu ŵangumbile jwannume ni jwankongwe. <verse eid="MRK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7"/>Kwa ligongo lyo jwannume chachinleka atatigwe ni achikulugwe, nombejo chalumbikane ni ŵankwakwe, <verse eid="MRK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8"/>ni ŵaŵili wo chachiŵa chiilu chimo. Sambano ngakuŵa ŵaŵili sooni, nambo chiilu chimo. <verse eid="MRK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9"/>Nipele, chalumbikenye Akunnungu, mundu ngasachilekanganya.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10"/>Paŵausile sooni mu nyuumba, ŵakulijiganya ŵaausisye Che Yesu nkati majiganyo go. <verse eid="MRK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11"/>Nombewo ŵaasalile, “Mundu jwalijose jwakunleka ŵankwakwe ni kulombela jwankongwe jwine, akuntendela chikululu ŵankwakwe. <verse eid="MRK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12"/>Iyoyo, jwankongwe jwakunleka jwannume jwao ni kulombwa ni jwannume jwine, akuntendela chikululu jwannume jwao.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwapa upile ŵanache</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matayo 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13"/>Ŵandu ŵampepe ŵannyichisye Che Yesu ŵanache achanandi ŵasajichile makono gao, nambo ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵaakalipile ŵandu wo. <verse eid="MRK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14"/>Che Yesu paŵaiweni yeleyo, yachimile ni ŵaasalile, “Mwaleche ŵanache achanandi aichanje kukwangu, kasimwalekasya, pakuŵa Umwenye wa Akunnungu uli wa ŵandu mpela ŵeleŵa. <verse eid="MRK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15"/>Isyene ngunsalila, mundu jwalijose jwangakuupochela Umwenye wa Akunnungu mpela ŵanache achanandi ngaajinjila mwelemo ng'oo.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16"/>Nipele, ŵajangete ŵanache ni kwasajichila makono ni kwapa upile.<verse eid="MRK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mundu jwachipanje</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matayo 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17"/>Che Yesu paŵatandite sooni ulendo wao, mundu jumo ŵambutuchile ni kwatindiŵalila ni ŵausisye, “Jwakwiganya jwambone, ana ndende chichi pakuti mbochele umi wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18"/>Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Ana ligongo chi nkuumilanga jwambone? Ngapagwa mundu jwaali jwambone ikaŵe Akunnungu jika pe. <verse eid="MRK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19"/>Ntakugamanyilila makanyo gagakuti, ‘Kasimmulaga ni Kasintenda chikululu ni Kasinjiŵa ni Kasinsala ya unami ni Kasimunnambuchisya njenu, ni Mwachimbichisye atati ŵenu ni achikulu ŵenu.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20"/>Mundu jula ŵajanjile, “Jwakwiganya, makanyo gose go nagakamulichisye chitandilile ku uwanache wangu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21"/>Che Yesu ŵalolechesye kwa kwanonyela, ŵansalile, “Chinsoŵile chindu chimo. Njaule nkasumisye yose inkwete, ni mbiya syo nkaape ŵakulaga, nombe mmwe chinkole chipanje kwinani kwa Akunnungu. Nipele nnyiche munguye.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22"/>Mundu jo paŵapilikene yeleyo, ŵapwele ntima ni ŵajawile achipukunyaga ntwe, pakuŵa ŵaliji ni ipanje yejinji ni nganasaka kwapa ŵane ipanje yao.<verse eid="MRK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23"/>Nipele Che Yesu ŵalolite kosekose, ni ŵaasalile ŵakulijiganya ŵao, “Chiilimbe kwannope kwa ŵandu ŵaipanje kwalechelela Akunnungu ŵaatawale!”<verse eid="MRK 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24"/>Ŵakulijiganya ŵagasimosile maloŵe gao, nambo Che Yesu ŵaasalile sooni, “Achiŵanangu, chiilimbe kwannope kwa ŵandu kwalechelela Akunnungu ŵaatawale! <verse eid="MRK 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25"/>Chiiŵe yakulimba kuchitenda chinyama chachikuŵilanjikwa ngamia, kupeleta pa chipowo cha sindano. Iyoyo peyo, ikuloleka kuti, chiiŵe yakulimba kwannope kwa mundu jwachipanje kwalechela Akunnungu ŵaatawale!”<figure style="fig" file="14 Camel.jpg" size="col" ref="10:25">Chinyama chachikuŵilanjikwa ngamia</figure><verse eid="MRK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26"/>Ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵasimosile nnope, ŵaliusisye, “Ana sambano nduni juchakombole kulupuswa?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27"/>Che Yesu ŵalolechesye ni kwasalila, “Kwa ŵandu ngaikukomboleka, nambo ngaŵa yeleyo kwa Akunnungu, pakuŵa kwa Akunnungu yanayose ikukomboleka.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28"/>Che Petulo ŵansalile Che Yesu, “Nnole! Ni uweji tulesile indu yose ni kunkuya mmwe!”<verse eid="MRK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29"/>Che Yesu ŵatite, “Isyene ngunsalila, mundu jwalijose jwajilesile nyuumba jakwe pane achapwakwe pane achalumbugwe pane achikulugwe pane atatigwe pane achiŵanagwe pane migunda, kwa ligongo lyangu une ni kwa ligongo lya Ngani Jambone, <verse eid="MRK 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30"/>mundu jo chapochele mbwee katema kakaka. Chapochele nyuumba syasijinji ni achalongo ni achalumbu ni achaŵelesi ni ŵanache ni migunda pamo ni masauko. Nambo mchilambo chachikwika, chapochele umi wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi. <verse eid="MRK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31"/>Nambo achajinji ŵakuliganichisya kuti ali achakulu sambano, chatuluswe ni ŵandu ŵakulitulusya sambano, chachiŵa achakulu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akuŵecheta kaatatu yankati chiwa chao</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matayo 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32"/>Che Yesu ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵaliji nkukwesya kwaula ku Yelusalemu nombe Che Yesu ŵalongolele. Ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵasimosile, ni ŵandu ŵaŵaliji nkwakuya wose ŵajogwepe. Che Yesu ŵaajigele sooni ŵakulijiganya ŵao likumi ni ŵaŵili pachisyepela, ni kwasalila indu ichiyakopochele. <verse eid="MRK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33"/>Ŵaasalile, “Mpilikane, tukukwesya kwaula ku Yelusalemu, ni kweleko Mwana jwa Mundu chajaule kukutyosyekwa kwa achakulu ŵambopesi ni ŵakwiganya Malajisyo. Ni ŵanyawo chanlamulile chiwa ni kwataga mmakono ga ŵandu ŵangaŵa Ŵayahudi. <verse eid="MRK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34"/>Nombe chaachintendela chanache ni chaachinsunila mata ni chaachimputa mbokola ni kumbulaga. Nambo pa lyuŵa lyaatatu chasyuche.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yakobo ni che Yohana akwaŵenda chindu Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Matayo 20:20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35"/>Nipele che Yakobo ni che Yohana ŵanache ŵa che Sebedayo, ŵajawile ku Che Yesu ni ŵatite, “Jwakwiganya, tukusaka ntupanganyichisye chindu chachitummende.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36"/>Che Yesu ŵausisye, “Ana nkusaka nampanganyichisye chichi?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37"/>Ni ŵajanjile, “Pachintawale mu ukulu wenu, tukummenda tutame jumo kundyo ni jwine kunchiji kwenu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38"/>Nambo Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Ngankuchimanyilila chinkuchiŵenda! Uli chinkombole kuching'welela chikombe cha masauko chingung'welela une pane kubatiswa mu ubatiso ungubatiswa une?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39"/>Ŵajanjile, “Tukupakombola.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Isyene chinng'welele chikombe chingung'welela une ni kubatiswa ubatiso ungubatiswa une. <verse eid="MRK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40"/>Ni kwa aŵala ŵachatame kundyo pane kunchiji kwangu, ngaŵa masengo gangu. Nambo Akunnungu chachapa lipesa lyo ŵele ŵaŵaasagwile.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41"/>Ŵele ŵakulijiganya likumi paŵapilikene chechila chiŵaŵendile che Yakobo ni che Yohana, ŵaatumbilile. <verse eid="MRK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42"/>Nipele, Che Yesu ŵaaŵilasile ŵakulijiganya wo ni ŵaasalile, “Nkumanyilila kuti ŵandu ŵakuganichikwa ali ilongola wa ŵandu ŵangaŵa Ŵayahudi, akwalongosya ŵandu ŵao kwa machili. Ni ŵele ilongola wo akwete ulamusi waukulungwa pachanya ŵandu ŵao. <verse eid="MRK 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43"/>Nambo ikaaŵa yeleyo kwa ŵanyamwe, sooni jwalijose jwakusaka kuŵa jwankulu pasikati jenu, aŵeje katumetume jwa wose. <verse eid="MRK 10:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44"/>Nombe jwalijose jwakusaka kuŵa jwankulu kupunda wose aŵeje kapolo jwa wose. <verse eid="MRK 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45"/>Pakuŵa Mwana jwa Mundu nganaika kukutumichilwa, nambo aiche kukutumichila ni kuutyosya umi wao kwa kwawombola ŵandu ŵajinji.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akunnamya che Batimayo jwangalola</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matayo 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46"/>Nipele, ŵaiche ku Yeliko. Che Yesu ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao pamo ni mpingo wekulungwa wa ŵandu paŵaliji nkutyoka mu musi wo, mundu jumo juŵaliji ngakulola, liina lyakwe che Batimayo mwanagwe che Timayo, ŵatemi mungulugulu litala achiŵendaga. <verse eid="MRK 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47"/>Paŵapilikene kuti ali Che Yesu jwa ku Nasaleti ŵaliji nkupita pelepo, ŵatandite kunyanyisya achitiji, “Che Yesu, Mwana ju che Daudi, mungolele chanasa!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48"/>Ŵandu ŵajinji ŵankalipile kuti amyalale, nambo jwelejo ŵajendelechele kunyanyisya achitiji, “Mwana ju che Daudi, mungolele chanasa!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49"/>Che Yesu ŵajimi ni ŵatite, “Mwaŵilanje.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Nipele, ŵammilasile mundu jwangalola jula, ŵansalile, “Nkamulisye ntima! Njimuche, akummilanga.”<verse eid="MRK 10:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50"/>Nombejo ŵaponyisye kwakutalichila mwinjilo wakwe, ŵagulwiche, ni ŵajaulile Che Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51"/>Che Yesu ŵammusisye jwelejo, “Nkusaka nampanganyichisye ichichi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">Jwangalola jo ŵanjanjile, “Jwakwiganya, ngusaka mbate kulola.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52"/>Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Njaule chikulupi chenu chinnamisye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:52">Papopo mundu jo ŵatandite kulola, nipele ŵalongene nawo Che Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11"/>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwinjila ku Yelusalemu kwa kuchina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1"/>Paŵaliji nkuŵandichila ku Yelusalemu, ŵaiche mmisinda ja ku Besefage ni ku Besania, chiŵandi ni Chikwesya cha Miseituni. Pelepo Che Yesu ŵaatumile ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵaŵili. <verse eid="MRK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2"/>Ni ŵaasalile, “Njaule pansinda wauli mmbujo mwenu, pachinkajinjileje po chinkansimane mwanambunda jwanganakwelekwe ni mundu kose, ali ataŵikwe, nkangopole ni kunnyika nawo apano. <verse eid="MRK 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3"/>Ambusyaga mundu, ‘Ligongo chi nkutenda yeleyo?’ Mwasalile, ‘Ambuje akunsaka, ni chaachimmusya mwachitema pe.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4"/>Nipele, ŵakulijiganya wo ŵajawile ni kunsimana mwanambunda ali ataŵikwe pachiŵandi ni nnango, muumbali mwa litala. Paŵangopolaga, <verse eid="MRK 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5"/>ŵandu ŵampepe ŵaŵajimi pelepo ŵausisye, “Uli, mbona nkungopola mwanambunda jo?”<verse eid="MRK 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6"/>Ŵakulijiganya ŵajanjile mpela iŵatite pakusalilwa ni Che Yesu, ni ŵandu ŵala ŵaalesile ajaule najo. <verse eid="MRK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7"/>Ŵampelechele Che Yesu mwanambunda jula. Ŵatandiche iwalo yao pangongo wa mwanambunda jula, ni Che Yesu ŵatemi pachanya pakwe. <verse eid="MRK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8"/>Ŵandu ŵajinji ŵatandiche iwalo yao mwitala, ni ŵane ŵatemenye nyambi sya mwana sya itela mmigunda ni kutandika mwitala kwa kwachimbichisya. <verse eid="MRK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9"/>Nipele ŵandu ŵaŵalongolele ni ŵane ŵaŵakuyaga panyuma ŵanyanyisye achitiji, “Alapikwe Akunnungu! Akunnungu ampe upile jwelejo jwakwika mu liina lya Ambuje! <verse eid="MRK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10"/>Akunnungu aupe upile umwenye waukwika wa atati ŵetu Mwenye che Daudi. Ajinichilwe Akumanani!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11"/>Che Yesu wajinjile mmusi wa ku Yelusalemu, ni ŵapelengenye pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu, ni ŵalolesyelolesye. Nambo pakuŵa jaliji ligulo, ŵajawile kunsinda wa ku Besania pamo ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao likumi ni ŵaŵili.<verse eid="MRK 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akuchilwesya chitela cha nkuju</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Matayo 21:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12"/>Malaŵi jakwe, paŵatyochelaga ku Besania, Che Yesu jakwete sala. <verse eid="MRK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13"/>Nipele, ali kwakutalichila ŵachiweni chitela cha ntini chana masamba gamajinji. Ŵajawile kukuchilola, alole iŵaga chakombole kupata chisogosi chachili chose. Paŵaiche pachitela pala ŵachisimene masamba pe pangali chisogosi, ligongo nganikaŵa katema kakwe ka kusogola. <verse eid="MRK 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14"/>Pelepo Che Yesu ŵachisalile chitela chila, “Chitandile sambano ni kuendelechela, ngapagwa mundu juchalye sooni isogosi yenu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:14">Ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵampilikene paŵaŵechete gelego.<verse eid="MRK 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwinjila pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matayo 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohana 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15"/>Nipele paŵaiche ku Yelusalemu, Che Yesu ŵajinjile pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu. Ni ŵatandite kwatopolela paasa, ŵandu ŵaŵaliji nkusumisya ni kusuma indu mwelemo. Ŵapikwile mesa sya ŵakutindanya mbiya ni itengu ya ŵandu ŵaŵasumisyaga nguunda. <verse eid="MRK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16"/>Iyoyo, ŵakanyisye mundu jwalijose akajigala chachili chose kutyochela pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu. <verse eid="MRK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17"/>Nipele, ŵajiganyisye, “Mmalembelo ga Akunnungu, Akunnungu akuti, ‘Nyuumba jangu chijiŵilanjikwe nyuumba ja kupopelela kwa ŵandu wose ŵa pachilambo!’ Nambo ŵanyamwe njitesile jiŵe mbugu ja kulisisila ŵa wiyi!”<verse eid="MRK 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18"/>Achakulu ŵambopesi ni ŵakwiganya Malajisyo paŵapilikene yelei, ŵatandite kusosa litala lya kwaulaga Che Yesu. Nambo ŵanjogwepe, ligongo ŵandu ŵajinji ŵaliji nkusimonga wiganye wakwe.<verse eid="MRK 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19"/>Pakwaswele, Che Yesu ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵakopweche musi wo.<verse eid="MRK 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lijiganyo lya chitela cha nkuju chachinyasile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Matayo 21:20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20"/>Kundaŵi jakwe, paŵapitaga ŵachiweni chitela cha ntini chila chili chijumwile koo, kutandilila mmichiga mpaka ku nyambi. <verse eid="MRK 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21"/>Che Petulo ŵagakumbuchile agala gaŵaŵechete Che Yesu, ni ŵansalile, “Jwakwiganya, nnole! Chitela cha ntini chimwalwesisye chila chijumwile!”<verse eid="MRK 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22"/>Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Mwakulupilile Akunnungu. <verse eid="MRK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23"/>Isyene ngunsalila, mundu achichisalilaga chitumbi chi, ‘Ntupuche nkaliponye mbahali,’ pangakola lipamba mu ntima mwakwe ni akulupililaga kuti chaŵechete cho chichitendekwe, chichitendekwe kukwakwe. <verse eid="MRK 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24"/>Kwa ligongo lyo ngunsalila, pankupopela ni kuŵenda chindu, nkulupilile kuti nkuchipochela, nombecho chichiŵe chenu. <verse eid="MRK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25"/>Pankupopela, iŵaga kwana mundu jwanneŵele, mwalechelesye yangalumbana yantendele, kuti Atati ŵenu ŵa kwinani annechelesye sambi syenu. <verse eid="MRK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26"/>Nambo iŵaga ngumwalechelesya ŵane sambi syao, Atati ŵenu ŵa kwinani nombe ngannechelesya sambi syenu.”<verse eid="MRK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Liusyo lyankati ulamusi u Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matayo 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27"/>Nipele ŵaiche sooni ku Yelusalemu. Che Yesu paŵaliji nkwendajenda pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu, achakulu ŵambopesi ni ŵakwiganya Malajisyo ni achachekulu ŵajaulile, <verse eid="MRK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28"/>ni ŵausisye, “Ana nkugatendekanya gelega kwa ulamusi wa acheni? Ŵaani ŵampele ulamusi wa kuitendekanya yeleyi?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29"/>Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “None chinambusye liusyo limo. Iŵaga chimunyanje none chinansalile kwa ulamusi wa acheni nguitenda indu yi. <verse eid="MRK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30"/>Musalile, ubatiso u che Yohana waumile kwinani, pane kwa ŵandu?”<verse eid="MRK 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31"/>Ŵanyawo ŵatandite kuusyana jwine ni jwine achitiji, “Twajilaga, ‘Waumile kwinani’, chatuusye, ‘Kwachichi nganimwakulupilila che Yohana?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32"/>Ni twatiji, ‘Waumile kwa ŵandu,’ chiiŵe uli?” Ŵaujogwepe mpingo wa ŵandu, pakuŵa ŵandu wose ŵakulupilile kuti che Yohana ŵaliji jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu. <verse eid="MRK 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33"/>Nipele, ŵanjanjile Che Yesu, “Ngatukumanyilila.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Nombejo ŵaasalile, “None jwakwe ngangunsalila kwa ulamusi wa acheni nguitendekanya yeleyi.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12"/>
  <para style="s">Chitagu cha ngunda wa misabibu ni ŵakulima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matayo 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1"/>Che Yesu ŵatandite kuŵecheta nawo kwa itagu achitiji, “Mundu jumo ŵalimile ngunda wa misabibu. Ŵausunguchisye lutenje ni ŵasolite pakuminyila sabibu, ni ŵataŵile chilindo cha penani. Nipele ŵaajasimisye ŵandu ngunda wo, nombejo ŵajawile kuchilambo chine.<figure style="fig" file="04 Winepress.jpg" size="col" ref="12:1">Ŵandu ŵaŵili akuminya sabibu peuto pakuminyila sabibu</figure> <verse eid="MRK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2"/>Katema ka magungulo, ŵantumile kapolo jwao ku ngunda wa misabibu kwa ŵakulima ŵala kukujigala chigaŵanyo cha magowolo gao. <verse eid="MRK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3"/>Ŵakulima ŵala ŵankamwile kapolo jo, ŵamputile ni kumminga makono pe. <verse eid="MRK 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4"/>Nipele nsyene ngunda jula, ŵantumile sooni kapolo jwine. Ŵakulima ŵala ŵammulesye mu ntwe kapolo jo ni kumpanganyichisya indu ya soni. <verse eid="MRK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5"/>Iyoyo peyo, nsyene ngunda jo ŵantumile sooni kapolo jwine, jwelejo ŵagambile kumbulaga. Ni ŵane ŵajinji uŵatumikwe, ŵane ŵaputikwe ni ŵane ŵaulajikwe.”<verse eid="MRK 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6"/>Che Yesu ŵajendelechele kuŵecheta, “Mundu jula ŵasigalilwe ni mundu jumo, mwanagwe jwakunonyelwa. Mbesi jakwe ŵantumile jwelejo achitiji, ‘Champikanile pakuŵa ali mwanangu.’<verse eid="MRK 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7"/>“Nambo ŵakulima ŵala paŵammweni ŵaŵechetesyene achitiji, ‘Aju ni juchapochele iŵagosele, twende tummulaje kuti indu iŵagosele tujigale uwe!’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8"/>Nipele ŵankamwile ni kummulaga ni kumponyela paasa pa ngunda wa misabibu wo.”<verse eid="MRK 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9"/>Che Yesu ŵausisye, “Nipele, ana nsyene ngunda wo chaachitenda chichi? Chaiche ni kwaulaga ŵakulima wo ni kwapa ŵakulima ŵane ngunda wa misabibu wo. <verse eid="MRK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10"/>Ana nganinsyome Mmalembelo ga Akunnungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">‘Liganga liŵalikanile ŵakutaŵa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">sambano, lilyolyo litendekwe liganga lyekulungwa lya nsingi.<verse eid="MRK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11"/>Ambuje ni ŵachitesile chindu chi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:11">nombecho chikutusimosya!’ ”<verse eid="MRK 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12"/>Achakulu ŵambopesi ni ŵakwiganya Malajisyo ni achachekulu, ŵaimanyi kuti chitagu cho chaliji nkwagamba ŵanyawo. Ŵasachile ŵakamule Che Yesu, nambo ŵajogwepe ŵandu, ŵannesile, ni ŵanyawo ŵatyosile.<verse eid="MRK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Liusyo lyankati kwausya nsongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matayo 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13"/>Kanyuma, Mafalisayo ŵampepe ni ŵandu ŵa mpingo u che Helode, ŵatumikwe kuti akaatanjisye Che Yesu kwa maloŵe gao. <verse eid="MRK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14"/>Ŵaajaulile ni kwasalila, “Jwakwiganya, tukumanyilila kuti alakwe ni mundu junkuŵecheta yaili isyene, pakuŵa ngankogopa ukulu wa mundu namose nganinkola lusagu, nambo nkwiganya usyene wa litala lya Akunnungu. Ntusalile, ana ili yambone pane ngaŵa yambone kwausya nsongo kwa Mwenye jwa ku Loma? Tujaule tukalipe pane tunajaule?”<verse eid="MRK 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15"/>Nambo Che Yesu ŵaumayilile ulamba wao, ŵausisye, “Kwachichi nkuuninga? Muunyichisye mbiya najilole.”<verse eid="MRK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16"/>Ŵampelechele mbiya jo. Nombejo ŵausisye, “Ana ku meeso ku ni liina li, ya acheni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Ni ŵanyawo ŵanjanjile, “Ya Mwenye jwa ku Loma.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17"/>Nipele Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Yaili ya Mwenye jwa ku Loma mwapeje Mwenye jwa ku Loma ni yaili ya Akunnungu mwapeje Akunnungu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Ŵandu ŵala ŵansimosile nnope Che Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Liusyo lyankati kusyuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matayo 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18"/>Nipele Masadukayo ŵakuti ngapagwa kusyuka ŵanjaulile Che Yesu ni kummusya, <verse eid="MRK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19"/>“Jwakwiganya, che Musa ŵatulembele kuti, ‘Mundu awililwagwa ni mpwakwe ni mundu jwawile jo annekaga ŵankwakwe pangali ŵanache, mpwakwe mundu jo akusachilwa annombele jwakuwililwa jo kuti ammelechele mpwakwe ŵanache.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20"/>Tujileje, ŵapali achachanda nsano ni ŵaŵili, jwa kwitiwo ŵalombele nambo ŵawile pangaleka mwanache. <verse eid="MRK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21"/>Ni jwaaŵili ŵajinjile majuumba, nombejo ŵawile pangaleka mwanache. Yakopochele iyoyo ni kwa mpwakwe jwaatatu. <verse eid="MRK 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22"/>Wose nsano ni ŵaŵili wo, ŵawile pangaleka ŵanache. Mbesi jakwe jwankongwe jo ŵawile nombejo. <verse eid="MRK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23"/>Nipele, pa lyuŵa lya kusyuka kwa ŵandu, jwankongwe jo chachiŵa jwa ŵaani? Pakuŵa achalongo wose nsano ni ŵaŵili ŵala ŵannombele jwelejo.”<verse eid="MRK 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24"/>Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Ŵanyamwe nsochele, ligongo ngankugamanyilila Malembelo ga Akunnungu namose machili ga Akunnungu. <verse eid="MRK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25"/>Ŵandu ŵawile pachachisyuka, ngasalombela atamuno kulombwa, chachiŵa mpela achikatumetume ŵa kwinani. <verse eid="MRK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26"/>Nambo ngani jankati kusyuka kwa ŵandu ŵawile, ana nganinsyome mmalembo ga che Musa, ngani ja chisukutu chichakolelaga mooto? Akunnungu ŵansalile che Musa, ‘Une ndili Akunnungu ŵa che Iblahimu ni Akunnungu ŵa che Isaka ni Akunnungu ŵa che Yakobo.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27"/>Nipele, ŵelewo nganaŵa Akunnungu ŵa ŵandu ŵawile, nambo ali Akunnungu ŵa ŵandu ŵajumi. Ŵanyamwe nsochele nnope.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lilajisyo lyekulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Matayo 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28"/>Jumo jwa ŵakwiganya Malajisyo ŵaiche pelepo ni ŵagapilikene makani gao. Paŵaiweni kuti Che Yesu ŵaajanjile uchenene Masadukayo ŵala, ŵansejelele Che Yesu ni kumbusya, “Ana Lilajisyo chi lyalili lyekulu kupunda gose?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29"/>Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Lilajisyo lyalili lyekulu ni ali: ‘Mpilikane, ŵanyamwe ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli! Ambuje Akunnungu ŵetu, jika pe ali Ambuje. <verse eid="MRK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30"/>Mwanonyele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵenu kwa ntima wenu wose ni kwa umi wenu wose ni kwa lunda lwenu wose ni kwa machili genu gose.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31"/>Lilajisyo lyaaŵili lyalili lyekulu lili ali: ‘Munnonyele njenu mpela inkuti pakulinonyela mwasyene.’ Ngapagwa Lilajisyo liine lyalili lyekulu kupunda Malajisyo gaŵili ga.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32"/>Nipele, jwakwiganya Malajisyo jula ŵansalile Che Yesu, “Jwakwiganya, njanjile yambone! Isyene Akunnungu ali ŵamo pe, ni ngapagwa jwine nambo ŵelewo jika pe. <verse eid="MRK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33"/>Ni mundu akusachilwa annonyele Akunnungu ni ntima wose ni lunda lwao lose ni machili gao gose ni kunnonyela njakwe mpela yakuti pakulinonyela nsyene. Kutenda yeleyo ili yambone kupunda kwatyochesya Akunnungu mbopesi sya kocha ni sadaka sine syasikutyosyekwa kwa Akunnungu.” <verse eid="MRK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34"/>Che Yesu paŵaiweni kuti mundu jo ajanjile kwa lunda ŵansalile, “Mmwejo nganimme kwakutalichila kwalechelela Akunnungu antawale.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:34">Kutandilila katema ko ngapagwa mundu juŵalinjile sooni kumbusya Che Yesu chachili chose.<verse eid="MRK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Liusyo lyankati Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matayo 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35"/>Che Yesu paŵaliji nkwajiganya ŵandu pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu, ŵausisye ŵandu, “Kwachichi ŵakwiganya Malajisyo akusala kuti Kilisito, ali jumo pe mu uŵelesi u che Daudi? <verse eid="MRK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36"/>Mbumu jwa Akunnungu ŵanlongwesye che Daudi, nombejo ŵatite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Ambuje ŵansalile Ambuje ŵangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">Ntame kundyo kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">mpaka pachinaatamiche ŵammagongo ŵenu paasi pa sajo syenu.’<verse eid="MRK 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37"/>“Che Daudi nsyene akummilanga Kilisito, ‘Ambuje,’ iŵele uli sooni Kilisito aŵe jumo pe mu uŵelesi u che Daudi?” Mpingo wa ŵandu ŵampilikanile kwa lukondwa.<verse eid="MRK 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwasalila ŵandu alilolechesye ni ŵakwiganya Malajisyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luka 20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38"/>Che Yesu paŵajiganyaga ŵatite, “Nlilolechesye ni ŵakwiganya Malajisyo ŵakusaka kwendajenda ali awete minjilo jajileu, ŵakunonyelwa akomasikwe kwa kuchimbichikwa peuto pakusumichisya malonda. <verse eid="MRK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39"/>Sooni akunonyelwa kutama mu itengu ya mmbujo, mmajumba ga kupopelela Ŵayahudi ni kutama mmauto ga kuchimbichikwa, pa chindimba cha chakulya. <verse eid="MRK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40"/>Kwa kwalambusya, akwasumula ipanje achakongwe ŵawililwe ni achiŵankwawo, ni kwa kulilosya kuti ali ŵandu ŵambone, akupopela mapopelo gamaleu. Kwalyele ligongo lyo, chalamulikwe kwa chikali nnope kupunda ŵandu ŵane.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sadaka ja jwakulaga jwawililwe ni ŵankwawo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luka 21:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41"/>Che Yesu ŵatemi chiŵandi ni lisanduku lya kugosela sadaka pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu, ŵaliji nkulolechesya ŵandu paŵalinji nkutaga mbiya. Ŵaipanje ŵajinji ŵatasile mbiya syasijinji. <verse eid="MRK 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42"/>Nipele ŵaiche jwankongwe jwakulaga jwawililwe ni ŵankwawo, jwelejo ŵatasile mbiya syasinandi siŵili. <verse eid="MRK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43"/>Pelepo Che Yesu ŵaaŵilasile ŵakulijiganya ŵao, ŵaasalile, “Isyene ngunsalila, jwankongwe jwakulaga jwawililwe ni ŵankwakwe ju, atasile yejinji mu lisanduku lya kugosela sadaka, kwapunda ŵandu ŵane wose. <verse eid="MRK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44"/>Pakuŵa ŵandu ŵane wose atasile sadaka syao kutyochela mu yakupunda ya mu ipanje yao. Nambo jwankongwe ju nkulaga kwakwe, atasile yose yakwete.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13"/>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akulondola nkati kugumulikwa kwa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matayo 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1"/>Che Yesu paŵaliji nkukopoka pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu, jumo jwa ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵatite, “Jwakwiganya, nlole maganga ga ni nyuumba si isitite pakusalala ni kusimosya!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2"/>Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Ana nkugawona majumba gamakulungwa ga? Ngalisigalila liganga pa liganga liine, liganga lyalililyose chilityochekwe.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulaga ni masauko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matayo 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3"/>Che Yesu paŵatemi pa chitumbi chachigumbele itela ya Miseituni chachikulolegana ni Nyuumba ja Akunnungu, che Petulo ni che Yakobo ni che Yohana ni che Andulea ŵausisye Che Yesu paŵaliji jika pe. <verse eid="MRK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4"/>“Choonde ntusalile, gelego chigakopochele chakachi? Ana chimanyisyo chi chachichilosye kuti gaŵandichile kukopochela gelego?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5"/>Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Nlilolechesye, mundu akanlambusya. <verse eid="MRK 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6"/>Ŵandu ŵajinji chaaiche kwa liina lyangu, achitiji, ‘Une ndili Kilisito!’ Nombewo chiŵalambusye ŵandu ŵajinji. <verse eid="MRK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7"/>Ni ŵanyamwe pachinchipikana ya ngondo ni usone wa ngani ja ngondo, ngasinjogopa. Gelego gakusachilwa gatyochele, nambo mbesi jila jikanaŵe kwika. <verse eid="MRK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8"/>Ŵandu ŵa chilambo chimo chaachimenyana ni ŵandu ŵa chilambo chine, ni ŵandu ŵa umwenye umo chaputane ni ŵandu ŵa umwenye wine. Chichityochele chindendemesi cha chilambo ni sala jajikulungwa panepane. Yele yose chiiŵe mpela ndande ja chilungusi cha kuligopola.<verse eid="MRK 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9"/>“Ŵanyamwe nlilolechesye, pakuŵa ŵandu chankamule ni kunjausya mmikungulu ni kumputanga mmajumba ga kupopelela Ŵayahudi. Chaachinjausya paujo pa ŵakulamula ni mamwenye ligongo lyangu kuti nkombole kuuŵalanjila umboni wa ngani syangu. <verse eid="MRK 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10"/>Nambo mbesi jikanaŵe kwika, Ngani Jambone jikusachilwa jilalichilwe kaje kwa ŵandu wose. <verse eid="MRK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11"/>Nombewo pachachinkamula ni kunjausya pankungulu, nkaganisya kaje ichimmechete. Mmecheteje chachili chose chachimpegwe katema ko, pakuŵa ngaŵa ŵanyamwe uchimmechete nambo Mbumu jwa Akunnungu. <verse eid="MRK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12"/>Nlongo changalauche nlongo njakwe aulajikwe, nombe atati changalauche mwanagwe aulajikwe, nombe ŵanache chiŵakane ni kwaulaga achaŵelesi ŵao. <verse eid="MRK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13"/>Ŵandu wose chaachinchima ŵanyamwe kwa ligongo lya liina lyangu. Nambo juchapililile mpaka kumbesi jo chakulupuswe mu kulamulikwa moŵa gose pangali mbesi.<verse eid="MRK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulaga kwakukulungwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Matayo 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14"/>“Nambo pachinchione, ‘Chindu cha uchimwa chachikwikanawo uwonasi,’ chijimi pangaŵa pakwe.” Jwakusyoma amanyilile malumbo gakwe. “Ŵandu ŵaali kuchilambo cha ku Yudea autuchile kumatumbi. <verse eid="MRK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15"/>Mundu jwali paasa nyuumba jao, akalikaŵisya kwinjila nkati kukujigala chindu, nambo agambe kuutuka! <verse eid="MRK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16"/>Ni mundu jwali kumigunda, akauja sooni kumusi kukujigala mwinjilo wakwe. <verse eid="MRK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17"/>Ngwakolela chanasa achakongwe ŵachakole itumbo ni ŵachajonjesye pa moŵa go, pakuŵa chalaje kwannope! <verse eid="MRK 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18"/>Mpopele kuti indu yo ikakopochela pa moŵa ga mbepo. <verse eid="MRK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19"/>Pakuŵa pa moŵa go ŵandu chalaje ulaje wanganiutyochele chitandile kundanda, Akunnungu paŵagumbile chilambo mpaka lelo, ni ngautyochela sooni. <verse eid="MRK 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20"/>Nambo ikaliji Ambuje ngakapungusye moŵa go, ngapagwa mundu jwakakulupwiche. Nambo kwa ligongo lya ŵandu ŵao ŵaŵasagwile, apungwisye moŵa go.<verse eid="MRK 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21"/>“Nipele, pa moŵa go ansalilaga mundu, ‘Nnole, Kilisito ali apano,’ pane ‘Ali apala,’ ngasimwakulupilila. <verse eid="MRK 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22"/>Pakuŵa chachikopochela ŵanya Kilisito ŵa unami ni ŵakulondola ŵa unami. Chachitenda imanyisyo ni yakusimosya, yakombolekaga, ŵalyungasye ŵandu ŵasagulikwe ni Akunnungu. <verse eid="MRK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23"/>Nambo ŵanyamwe nlilolechesye. Une masile kunsalila chile gose gakanaŵe kukopochela.<verse eid="MRK 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kwika kwa Mwana jwa Mundu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matayo 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24"/>“Nambo gamalaga moŵa ga malagasyo go, lyuŵa chilipilile ni lwesi ngalulanguchisya. <verse eid="MRK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25"/>Ndondwa sisipatuche kutyochela kwinani ni indu yose yaili ni machili kumaunde chiitinganyikwe. <verse eid="MRK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26"/>Pelepo chachimmona Mwana jwa Mundu, achiikaga mwiunde kwa machili gamakulungwa ni ukulu. <verse eid="MRK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27"/>Chiŵatume achikatumetume ŵao ŵa kwinani kukwasonganya ŵandu ŵaŵasagulikwe ni Akunnungu kutyochela mbande syose ncheche sya chilambo. Kutyochela kwakulikose pa chilambo.<verse eid="MRK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lijiganyo lya chitela cha nkuju</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matayo 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28"/>“Nlijiganye yeleyi kutyochela mu chitagu cha chitela cha ntini. Pankusiona nyambi syakwe sitepetele ni kusipuka masamba, nkumanyilila kuti katema ka ula kaŵandichile. <verse eid="MRK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29"/>Iyoyo peyo, ŵanyamwe pachinchiiona yeleyo ichikopochelaga, mmanyilile kuti, Mwana jwa Mundu aŵandichile nnope kwika. <verse eid="MRK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30"/>Isyene ngunsalila, uŵelesi wu ngaumala gakanaŵe kukopochela gele gose. <verse eid="MRK 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31"/>Kwinani ni chilambo chiimale, nambo maloŵe gangu chigakopochele isyene mpela indite pa kusala.<verse eid="MRK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngapagwa jwakulimanyilila lyuŵa lya mbesi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Matayo 24:36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32"/>“Nambo, pachanya lyuŵa lya mbesi namose saa jakwe, ngapagwa mundu jwakumanyilila, atamuno achikatumetume ŵa kwinani ngakumanyilila, namose Mwana jwa Akunnungu ngakumanyilila. Ikaŵe Atati Akunnungu pe ni ŵakumanyilila. <verse eid="MRK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33"/>Nlilolechesye ni kuliŵika chile, pakuŵa ngankukamanyilila katema ko chikaiche chakachi. <verse eid="MRK 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34"/>Chiichiŵa mpela mundu jwakwaula ulendo, kujileka nyuumba jakwe ni kwalechela ulamusi achikapolo ŵao, jwalijose ni masengo gakwe, nipele ŵannajisye jwakulindilila pannango kuti aŵeje meeso pe. <verse eid="MRK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35"/>Nipele nliŵiche chile, pakuŵa ngankumanyilila nsyene nyuumba chauje katema chi. Pane chauje ligulo, pane pasikati chilo, pane kuninkucha ni pane kundaŵi. <verse eid="MRK 13:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36"/>Nliŵiche chile, aujaga chisisimuchile, ansimane ndi meeso pe. <verse eid="MRK 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37"/>Ingunsalila ŵanyamwe ni ingwasalila wose, nliŵiche chile!”<verse eid="MRK 13:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14"/>
  <para style="s">Achakulu ŵambopesi akwilana kwaulaga Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohana 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1"/>Gasigalile moŵa gaŵili likanaŵe lyuŵa lya chindimba cha Pasaka ni chindimba cha mikate jangataga amila. Achakulu ŵambopesi ni ŵakwiganya Malajisyo ŵaliji nkusosa itajile pakwakamula Che Yesu, mwangamanyilila jwalijose ni kummulaga. <verse eid="MRK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2"/>Ŵatite, “Tukatenda yeleyo katema ka chindimba cha Pasaka, kuti ŵandu akatindiganya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jwankongwe akunjitilila Che Yesu mauta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matayo 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohana 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3"/>Che Yesu ŵaliji ku Besania, kumusi ku che Simoni juŵaliji jwamatana. Paŵalyaga, ŵaiche jwankongwe jumo juŵaliji ni chuupa chachikolochekwe ni liganga lyalikuŵilanjikwa alabasta, chachili ni mauta ga kununjila nnope ga ntengo wekulungwa gagakuŵilanjikwa nado. Ŵakasile chuupa cho, ni kwajitila mauta Che Yesu mu ntwe. <verse eid="MRK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4"/>Ŵandu ŵampepe ŵaŵaliji pamo ni Che Yesu yachimile achitiji, “Kwachichi akugajonanga mauta ga ntengo ga? <verse eid="MRK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5"/>Ngati akasumisye mauta ga ni kupata mbiya syasijinji ni kwapa ŵandu ŵakulaga!” Nipele ŵankalipile kwannope jwankongwe jo.<verse eid="MRK 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6"/>Nambo Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Munneche! Nkunsauchisya ichichi? Jweleju ambanganyichisye chindu chambone. <verse eid="MRK 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7"/>Ŵandu ŵakulaga chaŵe ni ŵanyamwe moŵa gose, iŵaga nkusaka kwakamuchisya nkukombola. Nambo une nguŵa ni ŵanyamwe moŵa gose. <verse eid="MRK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8"/>Jweleju atesile yakombwele. Alongolele kuchijitilila mauta chiilu changu, kuchiŵika chile, gakanaŵe masiiko gangu. <verse eid="MRK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9"/>Isyene ngunsalila, kwakulikose pachilambo pachijilalichikwe Ngani Jambone ni achi chatesile jwankongwe ju chichisalichikwe kwakwakumbuchila.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yuda akwitichisya kwagalauka Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matayo 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10"/>Nipele, che Yuda Isikaliote, jumo jwa achinduna kumi na mbili ŵala, ŵajawile kwa achakulu ŵambopesi kuti akombole kwagalauka Che Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11"/>Achakulu ŵambopesi ŵasangalele pakupikana ngani jo, ni ŵannanjile kuti chiŵaape mbiya. Nipele che Yuda ŵasosile lipesa lyambone lya kungalauka Che Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akulya chakulya cha Pasaka ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matayo 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luka 22:7-14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohana 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12"/>Pa lyuŵa lya kutanda lya chindimba cha mikate jangataga Amila, katema paŵasikitaga mwanangondolo jwa Pasaka, ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵausisye, “Ana kwapi nkusaka tukachikolochesye chakulya cha Pasaka?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13"/>Nipele Che Yesu ŵaatumile ŵaŵili mwa ŵakulijiganya ŵao ni ŵaasalile, “Njaule mu musi, ni mwelemo chinkasimane ni jwannume ali atwichile lulo lwa meesi. Nkankuye <verse eid="MRK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14"/>mpaka nyuumba jichakajinjile, nkansalile nsyene nyuumba jo, ‘Jwakwiganya akummusya, chili kwapi chuumba muchingalile chakulya cha Pasaka pamo ni ŵakulijiganya ŵangu?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15"/>Nombejo chakannosye chuumba chachikulungwa cha penani chachili chile ni kupambwa. Nkatukulumichisye mwelemo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16"/>Ŵakulijiganya ŵala ŵatyosile, ni kwaula mmusi, ŵaisimene yose ili mpela iŵatite pakusalilwa ni Che Yesu. Nombewo ŵakulumisye chakulya cha Pasaka.<verse eid="MRK 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17"/>Kuli kuswele, Che Yesu ŵaiche pamo ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao kumi na mbili. <verse eid="MRK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18"/>Paŵaliji aninkulya, Che Yesu ŵatite, “Isyene ngunsalila, jumo mwa ŵanyamwe jwakulya pamo ni une, chang'alauche.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19"/>Pelepo ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵatandite kusupuka, ni ŵatandite kummusya jumojumo, “Ana ndili une?” <verse eid="MRK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20"/>Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Jumo mwa ŵanyamwe kumi na mbili, jwakupamba nkate wakwe mu mbale pamo ni une. <verse eid="MRK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21"/>Pakuŵa Mwana jwa Mundu chawe mpela iilembekwe Mmalembelo Gamaswela nkati ŵelewo. Nambo chalaje mundu jwakungalauka Mwana jwa Mundu! Ikaliji mmbaya mundu jo ngakapagwe!”<verse eid="MRK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulya chakulya cha Ambuje</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matayo 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Ŵakolinto 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22"/>Paŵalyaga, Che Yesu ŵajigele nkate, ŵatogolele Akunnungu, ŵaugaŵenye ni kwapa ŵakulijiganya ŵao, achitiji, “Mpochele, nlyanje, chelechi ni chiilu changu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23"/>Sooni ŵajigele chikombe cha divai, ŵatogolele Akunnungu, ni kwapa, ni wose ŵang'welele divai mu chikombe cho. <verse eid="MRK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24"/>Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Jeleji ni miasi jangu ja lilangano lya Akunnungu, jajikwitika kwa ligongo lya kwalechelesya ŵandu ŵajinji. <verse eid="MRK 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25"/>Isyene ngunsalila, ngung'wa sooni divai mpaka lyuŵa paching'we divai jasambano mu Umwenye wa Akunnungu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26"/>Paŵamasile kwimba lujimbo lwa kwatogolela Akunnungu, ŵatyosile kwaula ku Chikwesya chachigumbele itela ya Miseituni.<verse eid="MRK 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akulondola ichajile pakukanikwa ni che Petulo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27"/>Che Yesu ŵaasalile ŵakulijiganya ŵao, “Ŵanyamwe wose chimmutuche ni kuuneka, pakuŵa Mmalembelo Gamaswela Akunnungu akuti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 14:27">‘Chinambulaje jwakuchinga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 14:27">ni ngondolo sisipwilingane.’<verse eid="MRK 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28"/>Nambo pachinjisyuka, chinjinnongolela kwaula ku Galilaya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29"/>Che Petulo ŵansalile, “Atamuno annekaga wose, une ngangunneka ng'oo!”<verse eid="MRK 14:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30"/>Che Yesu ŵansalile che Petulo, “Isyene ngunsalila, chilo cha lelo chino, tambala jikanaŵe kutongola kaŵili, chimungane katatu kuti ngankuumanyilila.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31"/>Nambo che Petulo ŵapundile kulimbila kuti, “Atamuno iŵaga ngusachilwa kuwa pamo nomwe ngangunneka ng'oo!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:31">Ni ŵakulijiganya ŵane ŵala ŵaŵechete iyoyo peyo.<verse eid="MRK 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akupopela ku Getesemane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matayo 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32"/>Ŵaichenje pa ngunda wa mwana waukuŵilanjikwa Getesemane, Che Yesu ŵaasalile ŵakulijiganya ŵao, “Ntamanje apano katema pangwaula kukwapopela Akunnungu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33"/>Nipele ŵaajigele che Petulo ni che Yakobo ni che Yohana, ŵatandite kusupuka kwannope ni kupotekwa mu ntima. <verse eid="MRK 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34"/>Ni ŵaasalile, “Ngupotekwa kwannope mu ntima ni chipwetesi chachikukombola kumulaga. Ntamanje apano ni kuŵa meeso pe.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35"/>Nipele ŵajawile mmbujo kanandi, ni ŵagwile manguuku, ŵapopelele kuti, yakombolekaga anajinjile mu katema ka malagasyo ko. <verse eid="MRK 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36"/>Ni ŵatite, “Atati wangu, yose ikukomboleka kukwenu. Mundyochesye chikombe cha malagasyo chi. Ngaŵa mpela ingusaka une, nambo mpela inkusaka mmwe.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37"/>Nipele, ŵausile kwa ŵakulijiganya ŵatatu ŵala, ni ŵaasimene agonile. Ŵammusisye che Petulo, “Che Simoni, uli ngonile? Nganinkombola kutama meeso pe namose saa jimo?” <verse eid="MRK 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38"/>Nipele ŵaasalile, “Ntamanje meeso pe ni kupopela kuti nkajinjila nkulinjikwa. Pakuŵa ntima ukusaka kupanganya yambone, nambo chiilu chilepetele.”<verse eid="MRK 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39"/>Ŵajawile sooni kukupopela achiujilaga maloŵe gagogo pego. <verse eid="MRK 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40"/>Paŵausile sooni, ŵasimene ŵakulijiganya ŵala ali agonile, ligongo ŵatopelwe ni lugono. Nombewo nganachimanyilila chakwajanga Che Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41"/>Kaatatu paŵaichilile ŵaasalile, “Ana ndi chigonele ni kupumulila? Sambano njimuche! Nnole, saa jiiche Mwana jwa Mundu akutajikwa mmakono ga ŵandu ŵaali ni sambi. <verse eid="MRK 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42"/>Njimuchanje, twende. Nnole mundu jwakung'alauka aŵandichile.”<verse eid="MRK 14:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akukamulwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohana 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43"/>Che Yesu paŵaliji nkuŵecheta, che Yuda, jumo jwa achinduna kumi na mbili, ŵaiche. Ŵaiche ni mpingo wa ŵandu ŵaŵatumikwe ni achakulu ŵambopesi ni ŵakwiganya Malajisyo ni achachekulu, ali ajigele mapanga ni imbonga. <verse eid="MRK 14:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44"/>Che Yuda jwakugalauka jula ŵapele ŵanyawo chimanyisyo chi, “Ajula juchingankomasye kwa kwanonyela ni jujojo junkunsaka. Munkamule ni kunlindilila.”<verse eid="MRK 14:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45"/>Che Yuda paŵaiche pe, papopo ŵajaulile Che Yesu ni kwasalila, “Jwakwiganya!” Nipele ŵankomasisye kwa unonyelo. <verse eid="MRK 14:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46"/>Nipele ŵandu ŵala ŵankamwile Che Yesu ni kuntaŵa. <verse eid="MRK 14:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47"/>Nambo jumo jwa ŵeŵala uŵajimi pelepo pamo ni Che Yesu, ŵasolomwele lipanga lyakwe ni kumputila kapolo jwa Jwambopesi Jwankulu, ni ŵankapile liwiwi. <verse eid="MRK 14:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48"/>Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Ana nnyiche ni mapanga ni imbonga kukungamula mpela ila une ndili jwachiswamba? <verse eid="MRK 14:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49"/>Moŵa gose naliji pamo ni ŵanyamwe njijiganyaga pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu, nganimungamula. Nambo sambano ngaleche Malembelo ga Akunnungu gamalile.”<verse eid="MRK 14:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50"/>Pelepo ŵakulijiganya ŵao wose ŵannesile ni kulukunula.<verse eid="MRK 14:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51"/>Jwapali jwanchanda jumo juŵaliji nkwakuya Che Yesu ali aliŵagele shuka pe. Ni ŵanyawo ŵasachile kunkamula, <verse eid="MRK 14:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52"/>nambo jwanchanda jula ŵapelete, ŵalesile shuka jila ni kutila matakope.<verse eid="MRK 14:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu mmbujo mwa Nkungulu wa achachekulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Matayo 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22:54-55</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">22:63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yohana 18:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53"/>Nipele, ŵampeleche Che Yesu ku nyuumba ja Jwambopesi Jwankulu, kuŵasongangene achakulu ŵambopesi wose ni achachekulu ni ŵakwiganya Malajisyo. <verse eid="MRK 14:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54"/>Che Petulo ŵankuiye Che Yesu kwakutalichila, ŵajinjile mu lutenje lwa nyuumba ja Jwambopesi Jwankulu. Pelepo ŵatemi pamo ni ŵakulindilila achijotelaga mooto. <verse eid="MRK 14:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55"/>Nipele, achakulu ŵambopesi ni ŵandu ŵane wose pa Nkungulu pala ŵasosile umboni wa kummechetela Che Yesu kuti ŵaulaje, nambo wasoŵile. <verse eid="MRK 14:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56"/>Ŵandu ŵajinji ŵaŵechetele Che Yesu umboni wa unami, nambo umboni wao nganiujilana.<verse eid="MRK 14:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57"/>Nipele ŵane wajimi ni kuŵecheta umboni wa unami, achitiji, <verse eid="MRK 14:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58"/>“Twampilikene ali nkuŵecheta, ‘Une chinajigumule Nyuumba ja Akunnungu ji, jajitaŵikwe ni ŵandu ni kutaŵa kwa moŵa gatatu jine jangataŵikwa ni ŵandu.’ ” <verse eid="MRK 14:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59"/>Namose yeleyo, umboni wao nganiujilana.<verse eid="MRK 14:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60"/>Nipele Jwambopesi Jwankulu ŵajimi paujo pa ŵandu ni kwausya Che Yesu, “Uli, ngankwanga chachili chose kwa wele umboni ŵakumbechetela wo?”<verse eid="MRK 14:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61"/>Nambo Che Yesu ŵaliji jii, nganaŵecheta chachili chose. Jwambopesi Jwankulu ŵammusisye sooni, “Ana mmweji ni Kilisito, Mwana jwa Akunnungu Ŵakulu?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62"/>Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Elo, ndili une. Sooni, chinchimmona Mwana jwa Mundu ali atemi kundyo kwa Akunnungu ŵa machili, ali nkwika mmaunde ga kwinani.”<verse eid="MRK 14:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63"/>Jwambopesi Jwankulu paŵapilikene yeleyo ŵapapwile mwinjilo wakwe achitiji, “Ngatukusaka sooni umboni wine nkati mundu ju! <verse eid="MRK 14:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64"/>Mumpilikene yatite pakwatukana Akunnungu! Ŵanyamwe nkuti uli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Wose ŵanlamwile aulajikwe.<verse eid="MRK 14:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65"/>Ŵandu ŵane ŵatandite kunsunila mata Che Yesu, ni ŵansiŵilile mmeeso ni ŵamputile ni kunsalila, “Nlondole, nduni jwamputile!” Iyoyo peyo ŵakulindilila ŵanjigele ni kumputa majanda.<verse eid="MRK 14:65"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Petulo akwakana Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Matayo 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohana 18:15-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">18:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66"/>Che Petulo paŵaliji chiŵela mu lutenje, ŵaiche mwali jumo mwa achikatumetume ŵa Jwambopesi Jwankulu. <verse eid="MRK 14:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67"/>Paŵammweni che Petulo achijotelaga mooto, ŵankolondolele ni kunsalila, “Nombe mmwejo iyoyo mwaliji pamo ni Che Yesu jwa ku Nasaleti.”<verse eid="MRK 14:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68"/>Nambo che Petulo ŵakanile achitiji, “Ngangwamanya namose nganguchimanyilila chinkuŵecheta cho.” Nipele ŵakopweche paasa, papopo tambala jatongwele.<verse eid="MRK 14:68"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69"/>Mwali jula ŵammweni sooni che Petulo, ŵatandite kwasalila ŵandu uŵajimi pelepo, “Mundu ju ali jumo jwao.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70"/>Nambo che Petulo ŵakanile sooni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Pangakaŵa, ŵandu uŵajimi pelepo ŵaasalile che Petulo, “Isyene mmwe ndi jumo jwao, pakuŵa mmwejo nombe ndi mundu jwa ku Galilaya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71"/>Nambo che Petulo ŵatandite kusala, “Nweseche iŵaga ngusala unami, ngulumbilila kuti, isyene ngangummanyilila mundu ju junkungamba.”<verse eid="MRK 14:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72"/>Papopo pepo tambala jatongwele kaaŵili. Che Petulo ŵalikumbuchile liloŵe li Che Yesu liŵaasalile, “Tambala jikanaŵe kutongola kaŵili, chimungane katatu.” Nipele ŵaligwisisye paasi ni kulila.<verse eid="MRK 14:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15"/>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu paujo pa che Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matayo 27:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">27:11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yohana 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1"/>Kundaŵi pe, achakulu ŵambopesi ni achachekulu ni ŵakwiganya Malajisyo, pamo ni Nkungulu wose, ŵatemi, ŵajilene kunjausya Che Yesu ku che Pilato. Nipele ŵantaŵile, ni kunjausya ku che Pilato. <verse eid="MRK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2"/>Che Pilato ŵammusisye Che Yesu, “Ana mmweji ndi mwenye jwa Ŵayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Elo, mpela mmwejo intite pakuŵecheta.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3"/>Achakulu ŵambopesi ŵaŵechetele Che Yesu maloŵe gamajinji. <verse eid="MRK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4"/>Che Pilato ŵammusisye sooni Che Yesu, “Ana ngakwanga chachili chose? Mpilikane maloŵe gose gakummechetela ga.”<verse eid="MRK 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5"/>Nambo Che Yesu nganajanga liloŵe, mpaka che Pilato ŵasimosile.<verse eid="MRK 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akulamulikwa chiwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matayo 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Yohana 18:39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6"/>Pa katema ka chindimba cha Pasaka, che Pilato ŵasyoŵelele kwagopolela jwataŵikwe juŵansachile ŵandu. <verse eid="MRK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7"/>Kwaliji ni jwataŵikwe jumo, liina lyakwe che Balaba, juŵaliji ataŵikwe pamo ni ŵandu ŵane ŵaŵatandisye utindiganyo ni kwaulaga ŵandu ŵane. <verse eid="MRK 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8"/>Mpingo wa ŵandu waichilile che Pilato, ŵatandite kwaŵenda ŵapanganyichisye mpela iŵatendaga. <verse eid="MRK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9"/>Che Pilato ŵausisye, “Ana nkusaka nangopolele Mwenye jwa Ŵayahudi?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10"/>Che Pilato ŵatite yeleyo pakuŵa ŵaimanyilile kuti, achakulu ŵambopesi ŵannyichisye Che Yesu kukwao ligongo lya kwakolela wiu.<verse eid="MRK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11"/>Nambo achakulu ŵambopesi ŵala, ŵachisisye ŵandu ŵaŵende che Pilato ŵagopolele che Balaba pamalo pa Che Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12"/>Che Pilato ŵausisye ŵandu sooni, “Sambano, nkusaka naapanganyichisye ichichi aju mundu junkuti Mwenye jwa Ŵayahudi?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13"/>Ŵanyanyisye sooni achitiji, “Mwaŵambe pa nsalaba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14"/>Nambo che Pilato ŵausisye, “Atesile chakusakala chanti uli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Nambo ŵanyawo ŵapundile kunyanyisya achitiji, “Mwaŵambe pa nsalaba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15"/>Che Pilato ŵasachile kwanonyelesya ŵandu, ŵagopolele che Balaba. Nipele ŵalamwile Che Yesu aputikwe mbokola ni kwapa ŵaŵambe pa nsalaba.<verse eid="MRK 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵangondo akwachembulusya Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Matayo 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yohana 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16"/>Ŵangondo ŵanjawisye Che Yesu pa nsana wa likome li che Pilato, jwankulu jwa chilambo. Ŵausimanisye mpingo wose wa ŵangondo. <verse eid="MRK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17"/>Ŵambwasisye mwinjilo wa sambalau nti mwenye, ŵakolosisye chindu mpela singwa ja miiŵa, ŵambwasisye mu ntwe. <verse eid="MRK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18"/>Nipele ŵatandite kunkomasya achitiji, “Kutusimana, Mwenye jwa Ŵayahudi!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19"/>Ŵamputile pa ntwe ni lubokola lwa nnasi, ŵansunile mata, ŵantindiŵalile ni kwakotamila. <verse eid="MRK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20"/>Paŵamasile kwachembulusya, ŵammusile mwinjilo wa sambalau ni kwawasya iwalo yao. Nipele ŵantyosisye paasa ni kwaŵamba pa nsalaba.<verse eid="MRK 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akuŵambikwa pa nsalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohana 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21"/>Paŵaliji mwitala, ŵasimene ni mundu liina lyao che Simoni, jwa ku Kulene jwaŵaliji atati ŵa che Alekisanda ni che Lufo. Jweleju ŵatyochelaga kunsinda kwinjila mmusi. Ŵangondo ŵankanganichisye atwichile nsalaba uŵajigele Che Yesu ula. <verse eid="MRK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22"/>Nipele ŵanjigele Che Yesu mpaka peuto papaŵilanjikwe Goligota, malumbo gakwe, “Peuto papakuloleka nti, Chikalakasa cha Ntwe.” <verse eid="MRK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23"/>Pelepo, ŵampele divai jewanganye ni ntela waukuŵilanjikwa manemane, nambo Che Yesu ŵakanile kung'wa. <verse eid="MRK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24"/>Ŵammambile pa nsalaba ni ŵagaŵene iwalo yakwe kwa kuitendela gudugudu, pakuti alole ŵaani chapate chiwalo chi. <verse eid="MRK 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25"/>Jaliji saa tatu kundaŵi paŵammambile pa nsalaba. <verse eid="MRK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26"/>Ni pachanya nsalaba, ŵaŵisile chindu chachilembekwe magambo ga, “MWENYE JWA ŴAYAHUDI.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27"/>Papopopepo ŵaŵambikwe pa misalaba ŵachiswamba ŵaŵili, jwine kundyo ku Che Yesu ni jwine kunchiji. <verse eid="MRK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28"/>Yeleyi yamalichisye Malembelo ga Akunnungu gagakuti, “Jwaŵichikwe pamo ni ŵandu ŵangalumbana.”<verse eid="MRK 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29"/>Ŵandu ŵaŵapitaga pelepo ŵapukunyaga mitwe jao ni kwatukana Che Yesu, alinkuti, “Ama! Mmwe ngati mwatiji chinchigumula Nyuumba ja Akunnungu, ni kujitaŵa kwa moŵa gatatu! <verse eid="MRK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30"/>Sambano, ntuluche pa nsalaba, ndikulupusye mwasyene!”<verse eid="MRK 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31"/>Iyoyo peyo achakulu ŵambopesi ni ŵakwiganya Malajisyo wala ŵanchembulwisye achisalilanaga, “Ŵakulupwisye ŵandu ŵane, nambo ngakukombola kulikulupusya nsyene! <verse eid="MRK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32"/>Nneche twalole Kilisito, Mwenye jwa Isilaeli! Atuluche etu pa nsalaba po kuti tulole ni kwakulupilila.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:32">Iyoyo peyo ŵandu uŵaŵambikwe pa misalaba chiŵandi ni Che Yesu, ni ŵanyawo nombe ŵaliji nkutukana.<verse eid="MRK 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chiwa chi Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohana 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33"/>Palyaiche lyuŵa pantwe, chilambo chose chaunichikwe ni chipi mpaka saa tisa ja muusi. <verse eid="MRK 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34"/>Saa tisa ja muusi Che Yesu ŵanyanyisye achitiji, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabakitani?” Malumbo gakwe, “Akunnungu ŵangu, Akunnungu ŵangu, kwachichi munesile?”<verse eid="MRK 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35"/>Aŵala ŵandu ŵane ŵaŵajimi pepala ŵala, paŵapilikene maloŵe go ŵatite, “Mpilikanile! Akwaŵilanga che Elia!” <verse eid="MRK 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36"/>Jumo jwao ŵautwiche kukunyoya chindu mpela lidodoki mu divai jakuŵipa, ŵakoleche pa nnasi, ŵambichile Che Yesu pakang'wa, achitiji, “Nneche tulole iŵaga che Elia chaiche kukuntulusya pa nsalaba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37"/>Nipele Che Yesu ŵanyanyisye ni ŵajasiche.<verse eid="MRK 15:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38"/>Katema kakoko, nguo ja lusasa ja mu Nyuumba ja Akunnungu japapwiche pambindikati, kutyochela penani mpaka paasi. <verse eid="MRK 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39"/>Jwankulu jwa ŵangondo juŵajimi mmbujo mwa nsalaba, paŵaweni Che Yesu ajasiche kwanti yeleyo, ŵatite, “Isyene mundu ju ŵaliji Mwana jwa Akunnungu!”<verse eid="MRK 15:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40"/>Achakongwe ŵampepe ŵaliji nkulolechesya kwakutalichila. Mwa ŵanyawo, ŵapali che Maliamu jwa musi wa ku Magidala ni che Salome ni che Maliamu achikulu ŵao che Yakobo jwannandi ni che Yusufu. <verse eid="MRK 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41"/>Achakongwe ŵa ni aŵala ŵaŵaliji nkwakuya Che Yesu paŵaliji ku Galilaya ni kwatumichila. Iyoyo peyo ŵapali achakongwe ŵane pepala, ŵaŵaiche ku Yelusalemu pamo nawo.<verse eid="MRK 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chiilu chi Che Yesu chikuŵichikwa mwilembe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohana 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42"/>Lyaiche ligulo lya lyuŵa lya kuliŵika chile, likanaŵe Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila. <verse eid="MRK 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43"/>Che Yusufu jwa musi wa ku Alimataya, juŵaliji jumo jwa achakulu ŵa Nkungulu ni jwakuchimbichikwa nnope ŵaiche. Jwelejo ŵaliji nkulolela kwika kwa Umwenye wa Akunnungu. Nipele che Yusufu ŵanjaulile che Pilato pangajogopa ni kwaŵenda ŵaape chiilu chi Che Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44"/>Che Pilato ŵasimosile kupilikana kuti Che Yesu ajasiche. Nipele, ŵammilasile jwankulu jwa ŵangondo, ŵambusisye iŵaga Che Yesu ŵajasiche. <verse eid="MRK 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45"/>Nipele, che Pilato paŵaimanyi kutyochela kwa jwankulu jwa ŵangondo jula, ŵannechele che Yusufu ajigale chiilu chi Che Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46"/>Che Yusufu ŵasumile saanda, ni ŵachitulwisye paasi chiilu chi Che Yesu ni kuchiŵilijila saanda jila. Ŵachiŵisile mwilembe lilyasepekwe pa lwala. Nipele ŵalipitikulile liganga lyalikulungwa pannango. <verse eid="MRK 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47"/>Che Maliamu jwa musi wa ku Magidala pamo ni che Maliamu achikulugwe che Yusufu ŵapaweni pelepo paŵachiŵisile chiilu chi Che Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 15:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16"/>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akusyuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matayo 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:11-12">Luka 24:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohana 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1"/>Palyapite Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila, che Maliamu jwa musi wa ku Magidala ni che Salome ni che Maliamu achikulugwe che Yakobo ŵagasumile mauta gakununjila. Ŵajawile kukuchipakasya chiilu chi Che Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2"/>Kundaŵi pe, lyuŵa lyaandanda lya chijuma, lyuŵa lininkukopoka ŵaiche kumalembe. <verse eid="MRK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3"/>Nombewo paŵaliji mwitala ŵausyanaga, “Ana ŵaani juchakatugalambulile liganga pannango wa lilembe?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4"/>Nambo paŵalolechesye, ŵaliweni liganga lyekulungwa nnope lila lili lyegalambulile pambali. <verse eid="MRK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5"/>Pele ŵajinjile mwilembe, ŵammweni jwanchanda jwawete chiwalo cheswela ali atemi kundyo ni ŵasimosile nnope.<verse eid="MRK 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6"/>Nambo jwanchanda jula ŵaasalile, “Kasinsimonga, nguimanyilila kuti nkunsosa Che Yesu jwa ku Nasaleti juŵammambile pa nsalaba. Nganapagwa pelepa, asyuchile. Nnole peuto paŵangoneche. <verse eid="MRK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7"/>Nambo ŵanyamwe njaule nkasalile che Petulo ni ŵakulijiganya ŵane kuti, ‘Che Yesu alongolele kwaula ku Galilaya. Kweleko chinkaawone mpela iŵatite pakunsalila.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8"/>Nipele, ŵatyosile kumalembe ali nkuutuka ni ali nkutetemela kwa lipamba ni kusimonga. Nganasala chindu chachili chose kwa mundu, pakuŵa ŵaliji nkogopanga kwannope.<verse eid="MRK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akunkopochela che Maliamu jwa musi wa ku Magidala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Matayo 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yohana 20:11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9"/>Che Yesu paŵasyuchile, kundaŵi pe, lyuŵa lyaandanda lya chijuma ŵankopochele kaje che Maliamu jwa musi wa ku Magidala, ajula jwaŵankopwesye masoka nsano ni gaŵili. <verse eid="MRK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10"/>Che Maliamu jwa musi wa ku Magidala, ŵajawile ni kwasalila aŵala ŵakulijiganya ŵa Che Yesu, katema ko ŵanyawo ŵaliji nkulila ni kulila kwa malumbo. <verse eid="MRK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11"/>Nambo paŵapilikene kuti Che Yesu asyuchile ni kuti che Maliamu jwa musi wa Kumagidala ammweni, nganiŵakulupilila.<verse eid="MRK 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwakopochela ŵakulijiganya ŵaŵili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luka 24:13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12"/>Kanyuma kakwe Che Yesu ŵakopochele ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵaŵili ŵaŵaliji nkwaula mmisinda. Ni ŵakulijiganya wo, kundanda nganiŵaamanyilila. <verse eid="MRK 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13"/>Nombewo ŵausile kukwasalila ŵakulijiganya achinjao, ni ŵanyawo nombe, nganiŵakulupilila iyoyo.<verse eid="MRK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwakopochela ŵakulijiganya ŵao likumi ni jumo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohana 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Masengo 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14"/>Mbesi jakwe Che Yesu ŵaakopochele ŵakulijiganya ŵao likumi ni jumo paŵaliji nkulya. Nipele, ŵaakalipile kwa ungakulupilila ni kukakatima kwa mitima jao, pakuŵa nganiŵakulupilila aŵala ŵaŵaweni ŵelewo pakumala kusyuka. <verse eid="MRK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15"/>Ni ŵaasalile, “Njaulanje pachilambo pose nkalalichile Ngani Jambone kwa ŵandu wose. <verse eid="MRK 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16"/>Mundu jwalijose juchakulupilile ni kubatiswa, Akunnungu chankulupusye. Nambo mundu jwangakukulupilila, Akunnungu chanlamule. <verse eid="MRK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17"/>Ni wose ŵachakulupilile chaitendekanye imanyisyo yanti, chagakoposye masoka kwa liina lyangu ni kuŵecheta chiŵecheto chasambano. <verse eid="MRK 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18"/>Akamulangaga majoka pane kung'wa chindu chachilichose chakuulaga, ngachaulaga. Chaachasajichila makono ŵakulwala, ni Akunnungu chiŵaalamye.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akujigalikwa kwaula kwinani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luka 24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Masengo 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19"/>Nipele, Ambuje Che Yesu paŵamasile kuŵecheta nawo, ŵajigalikwe kwaula kwinani, ni ŵatemi kunkono wa kundyo wa Akunnungu. <verse eid="MRK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20"/>Nombe ŵakulijiganya ŵala, ŵajawile kukulalichila Ngani Jambone palipose. Ambuje ŵapangenye masengo pamo nawo ni kutendekanya imanyisyo yejinji, kulosya kuti utenga waukwagamba ŵelewo, uli isyene.<verse eid="MRK 16:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16"/>
</usx>
